#: src/introduction.md:1
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "はじめに"

#: src/introduction.md:3
msgid ""
"This manual describes the mathematics of ExchangeAlgebra and how to use its "
"Haskell operations. Start with [From journal entries to exchange algebra]"
"(overview.md), which maps a journal table onto the algebra's notation. "
"[Definitions and axioms](algebra/definitions.md) then defines how the "
"library represents postings and separates debits from credits. For module "
"documentation and the full API, see the [Haddock reference on Hackage]"
"(https://hackage.haskell.org/package/exchangealgebra)."
msgstr ""
"このマニュアルでは, ExchangeAlgebra の数学的基盤と Haskell の演算の使い方を説"
"明します. まず, 仕訳帳の表と代数の記法を対応づける[仕訳から交換代数へ]"
"(overview.md)を読んでください. [定義と公理](algebra/definitions.md)では, ライ"
"ブラリが項 (posting) を表現し, 借方と貸方に分ける方法を定義します. モジュール"
"の説明と API の全体については, [Hackage の Haddock リファレンス](https://"
"hackage.haskell.org/package/exchangealgebra)を参照してください."

#: src/overview.md:1
msgid "From journal entries to exchange algebra"
msgstr "仕訳から交換代数へ"

#: src/overview.md:3
msgid ""
"This page maps a journal written as a debit and credit table onto exchange "
"algebra notation, using four transactions of a small shop. It assumes "
"familiarity with double-entry bookkeeping and no knowledge of the algebra. "
"[Definitions and axioms](algebra/definitions.md) gives the formal "
"definitions."
msgstr ""
"小さな店舗の 4 件の取引を使い, 借方と貸方の表で書いた仕訳帳を交換代数の記法に"
"対応づけます. 複式簿記の知識を前提としますが, 交換代数の知識は必要ありませ"
"ん. 形式的な定義は[定義と公理](algebra/definitions.md)を参照してください."

#: src/overview.md:5
msgid "A journal as a table"
msgstr "表で表す仕訳帳"

#: src/overview.md:7
msgid ""
"Table 1 records the four transactions in a conventional journal. Each row "
"has one debit account and one credit account with the same amount."
msgstr ""
"表 1 は, 4 件の取引を通常の仕訳帳に記録したものです. 各行は, 同額の借方科目 "
"1 つと貸方科目 1 つからなります."

