msgstr "resolver"

#: src/usage/installation.md:12
msgid "lts-24.65"
msgstr "lts-24.65"

#: src/usage/installation.md:12
msgid "packages"
msgstr "packages"

#: src/usage/installation.md:14
msgid "extra-deps"
msgstr "extra-deps"

#: src/usage/installation.md:16
msgid "exchangealgebra-0.6.0.1"
msgstr "exchangealgebra-0.6.0.1"

#: src/usage/installation.md:19
msgid ""
"Add the library to your `package.yaml` dependencies. Preserve any other "
"dependencies your program needs:"
msgstr ""
"`package.yaml` の依存にライブラリを追加してください. プログラムが必要とする他"
"の依存は残してください:"

#: src/usage/installation.md:22
msgid "dependencies"
msgstr "dependencies"

#: src/usage/installation.md:23
msgid "base"
msgstr "base"

#: src/usage/installation.md:24
msgid "exchangealgebra == 0.6.0.1"
msgstr "exchangealgebra == 0.6.0.1"

#: src/usage/installation.md:27
msgid ""
"`extra-deps` selects the package source for Stack; the dependency in "
"`package.yaml` makes the library available to your program. Run `stack "
"build` in the project directory to build the project and its dependencies. "
"For a Cabal project, put `exchangealgebra == 0.6.0.1` in the component's "
"`build-depends` instead."
msgstr ""
"`extra-deps` は Stack が取得するパッケージのソースを選びます. `package.yaml` "
"の依存指定は, プログラムからライブラリを使えるようにします. プロジェクトの"
"ディレクトリで `stack build` を実行し, プロジェクトとその依存をビルドしてくだ"
"さい. Cabal プロジェクトの場合は, 代わりにコンポーネントの `build-depends` "
"に `exchangealgebra == 0.6.0.1` を指定してください."

#: src/usage/installation.md:29
msgid "Choose imports by layer"
msgstr "層ごとに import を選ぶ"

#: src/usage/installation.md:31
msgid ""
"`ExchangeAlgebra` is a convenience module. It re-exports named selections of "
"the Algebra API, account titles and classifications, accounting exchange "
"operations, transfers and closing, trial-balance readouts, statement "
"presentation, CSV and bookkeeping output, and money types. It does not re-"
"export every public module. In particular, import `ExchangeAlgebra.Journal` "
"qualified and import `matchesQuery` from `ExchangeAlgebra.Algebra.Element` "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"`ExchangeAlgebra` は利便性のためのモジュールです. Algebra API から選んだ名"
"前, 勘定科目と分類, 会計の交換演算, 振替と決算, 試算表の読み出し, 財務諸表の"
"表示, CSV と帳簿の出力, 金額の型を再エクスポートします. すべての公開モジュー"
"ルを再エクスポートするわけではありません. 特に, `ExchangeAlgebra.Journal` は"
"修飾付きで import し, `matchesQuery` は `ExchangeAlgebra.Algebra.Element` か"
"ら直接 import してください."

#: src/usage/installation.md:33
msgid ""
"The module table lists public entry points in 0.6.0.1. Import a specific "
"module to restrict the imported names to that part of the library."
msgstr ""
"モジュールの表は, 0.6.0.1 の公開されているエントリポイントを示します. import "
"する名前をライブラリの特定の部分に限定するには, 個別のモジュールを import し"
"てください."

#: src/usage/installation.md:35
msgid "Layer"
msgstr "層"

#: src/usage/installation.md:35
msgid "Modules to import"
msgstr "import するモジュール"

