msgstr "仕訳帳"

#: src/usage/installation.md:40
msgid "`ExchangeAlgebra.Journal`, `ExchangeAlgebra.Journal.Transfer`"
msgstr "`ExchangeAlgebra.Journal`, `ExchangeAlgebra.Journal.Transfer`"

#: src/usage/installation.md:40
msgid ""
"Postings indexed by notes, and transformations of those journals. Use "
