msgstr "会計"

#: src/usage/installation.md:41
msgid ""
"`ExchangeAlgebra.Accounting`, `ExchangeAlgebra.Accounting.Account`, "
"`ExchangeAlgebra.Accounting.Exchange`"
msgstr ""
"`ExchangeAlgebra.Accounting`, `ExchangeAlgebra.Accounting.Account`, "
