#: src/usage/installation.md:41
msgid ""
"Account titles, account classification, and debit and credit operations."
msgstr "勘定科目, 勘定の分類, 借方と貸方の演算."

#: src/usage/installation.md:42
msgid ""
"`ExchangeAlgebra.Accounting.TrialBalance`, `.Entries`, `.Closing`, "
