msgstr "Simulation 層はこのマニュアルの対象外です."

#: src/usage/installation.md:47
msgid ""
"For the [account divisions and side decompositions](../algebra/"
"definitions.md#account-classes-and-sides), "
"`ExchangeAlgebra.Accounting.Exchange` provides `ExBaseClass` with `whatDiv` "
"and `whichSide`, and `Exchange` with `decL`, `decR`, and `balance`. `decL` "
"selects debit postings and `decR` selects credit postings. `balance` "
"compares their exact totals before rounding. The [journal example](../"
"overview.md#recover-the-debit-and-credit-columns) uses these functions "
"through `ExchangeAlgebra`."
msgstr ""
"[勘定の区分と貸借分解](../algebra/definitions.md#account-classes-and-sides)に"
"ついては, `ExchangeAlgebra.Accounting.Exchange` が, `whatDiv` と `whichSide` "
"を持つ `ExBaseClass`, および `decL`, `decR`, `balance` を持つ `Exchange` を提"
"供します. `decL` は借方の項を選び, `decR` は貸方の項を選びます. `balance` は"
"丸める前の厳密な合計を比較します. [仕訳帳の例](../overview.md#recover-the-"
"debit-and-credit-columns)では, `ExchangeAlgebra` を通じてこれらの関数を使いま"
"す."

#: src/usage/installation.md:49
msgid "Build the withdrawal"
msgstr "引き出しを構築する"

#: src/usage/installation.md:51
msgid ""
"Save the complete program as `Main.hs`. It records a withdrawal of 3,000 yen "
"from Bank A's savings account on January 10: cash increases, and deposits "
"decrease. `Cash` and `Deposits` are built-in account titles, and the built-"
"in `CountUnit` supplies `Yen`. The date and bank-account description are "
"omitted from the bases because these balances combine dates and do not "
"distinguish bank accounts."
msgstr ""
"完全なプログラムを `Main.hs` として保存してください. 1 月 10 日に A 銀行の普"
"通預金口座から 3,000 円を引き出す取引を記録します. 現金が増加し, 預金が減少し"
"ます. `Cash` と `Deposits` は組み込みの勘定科目であり, 組み込みの "
"`CountUnit` が `Yen` を提供します. ここで求める残高は日付をまとめ, 銀行口座を"
"区別しないため, 日付と銀行口座の記述は基底から省きます."

#: src/usage/installation.md:57
