#: src/journal/journal.md:178 src/journal/agents.md:136
msgid "Reference"
msgstr "リファレンス"

#: src/algebra/elements.md:101
msgid "Element methods"
msgstr "Element のメソッド"

#: src/algebra/elements.md:103
msgid ""
"`Element` requires `Eq`, `Ord`, `Show`, `Hashable`, and `Typeable`. Equality "
"and ordering must agree, and equal values must have equal hashes. The "
"wildcard remains an ordinary value for identity and ordering; the derived "
"order of the custom unit is `Yen < Dollar < Unit`."
msgstr ""
"`Element` は `Eq`, `Ord`, `Show`, `Hashable`, `Typeable` を要求します. 等値性"
"と順序は整合し, 等しい値は等しいハッシュを持つ必要があります. 同一性と順序に"
"おいて, wildcard は通常の値のままです. 独自の単位について導出される順序は "
"`Yen < Dollar < Unit` です."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:105
msgid "Method or function"
msgstr "メソッドまたは関数"

#: src/algebra/elements.md:105
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "意味"

#: src/algebra/elements.md:107
msgid "`wildcard`, or the alias `(.#)`"
msgstr "`wildcard`, または別名 `(.#)`"

#: src/algebra/elements.md:107
msgid "The distinguished wildcard value of the inferred type."
msgstr "推論された型の特別な wildcard の値."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:108
msgid "`isWildcard x`"
msgstr "`isWildcard x`"

#: src/algebra/elements.md:108
msgid "Whether `x` equals the whole wildcard value."
msgstr "`x` が wildcard の値全体に等しいかどうか."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:109
msgid "`haveWildcard x`"
msgstr "`haveWildcard x`"

#: src/algebra/elements.md:109
msgid "Whether `x` contains a wildcard coordinate, including inside a tuple."
msgstr "`x` がタプルの内部も含めて wildcard の座標を含むかどうか."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:110
msgid "`ignoreWildcard before after`"
msgstr "`ignoreWildcard before after`"

#: src/algebra/elements.md:110
msgid ""
"Keep coordinates of `before` where `after` has wildcards; otherwise use "
"`after`."
msgstr ""
"`after` が wildcard である座標では `before` の座標を保持し, それ以外では "
"`after` を使います."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:111
msgid "`equal`, `(.==)`, `(./=)`"
msgstr "`equal`, `(.==)`, `(./=)`"

#: src/algebra/elements.md:111
msgid ""
"Symmetric wildcard-aware comparison and its negation. `(.==)` also handles "
"partially wildcarded tuples."
msgstr ""
"wildcard を考慮した対称な比較とその否定. `(.==)` は一部の座標が wildcard であ"
"るタプルも扱います."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:112
msgid "`compareElement`"
msgstr "`compareElement`"

#: src/algebra/elements.md:112
msgid ""
"Return `EQ` for a wildcard match, otherwise compare with the ordinary order; "
"tuples compare coordinate by coordinate."
msgstr ""
"wildcard による照合で一致すれば `EQ` を返し, それ以外では通常の順序で比較しま"
"す. タプルは座標ごとに比較します."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:113
msgid "`(.<)`, `(.>)`, `(.<=)`, `(.>=)`, `maxElement`, `minElement`"
msgstr "`(.<)`, `(.>)`, `(.<=)`, `(.>=)`, `maxElement`, `minElement`"

#: src/algebra/elements.md:113
msgid "Comparisons and selection using `compareElement`."
msgstr "`compareElement` を使った比較と選択."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:114
msgid "`matchesQuery query entry`"
msgstr "`matchesQuery query entry`"

#: src/algebra/elements.md:114
msgid ""
"One-way query matching. Import it from `ExchangeAlgebra.Algebra.Element`."
msgstr ""
"片方向の問い合わせの照合. `ExchangeAlgebra.Algebra.Element` から import して"
"ください."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:116
msgid ""
"`wildcard` is the only required method for a simple coordinate type. Tuples "
"implement wildcard substitution and matching component by component. In a "
"transfer target, a wildcard preserves the source coordinate."
msgstr ""
"単純な座標の型では, 必須のメソッドは `wildcard` だけです. タプルは, 成分ごと"
"に wildcard の置換と照合を実装します. 振替先では, wildcard は元の座標を保持し"
"ます."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:118
msgid ""
"**Caution:** `(.==)` is symmetric. Use `matchesQuery` to match queries "
"against stored coordinates. Use ordinary `==` and `compare` for identity and "
"canonical ordering; wildcard-aware comparison is not a total order on stored "
"values."
msgstr ""
"**注意:** `(.==)` は対称です. 問い合わせを記録された座標と照合するには, "
"`matchesQuery` を使ってください. 同一性と正準的な順序には, 通常の `==` と "
"`compare` を使ってください. wildcard を考慮した比較は, 記録された値の全順序で"
"はありません."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:120
msgid "Built-in instances"
msgstr "組み込みの instance"

#: src/algebra/elements.md:122
msgid "Type"
msgstr "型"

#: src/algebra/elements.md:122
msgid "Wildcard"
msgstr "wildcard"

