msgstr "プログラム全体の出力は次のとおりです:"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:97
msgid ""
"The labeled `Cash increase` and `Deposit decrease` results retain the same "
"unit and distinct account titles. `Reverse the cash direction` retains the "
"cash coordinate and changes only its direction."
msgstr ""
"`Cash increase` と `Deposit decrease` というラベルの結果は, 同じ単位と異なる"
"勘定科目を保持しています. `Reverse the cash direction` は現金の座標を保持し, "
"方向だけを変えます."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:99
msgid ""
"**Caution:** Hat is a structural direction, not a negative amount or a debit "
"label. Both Cash and Deposits are assets, so an increase is a debit and a "
"decrease is a credit. Other account divisions have different home sides. "
"`HatNot` is a query wildcard, not a posting direction; direction reversal "
"and tests are intended for concrete `Hat` or `Not` bases, and some methods "
"fail on `HatNot`."
msgstr ""
"**注意:** Hat は構造上の方向であり, 負の金額や借方を表すラベルではありませ"
"ん. 現金と預金はいずれも資産なので, 増加は借方, 減少は貸方です. 他の勘定区分"
"では本来の側が異なります. `HatNot` は問い合わせの wildcard であり, 項の方向で"
"はありません. 方向の反転と判定は具体的な `Hat` または `Not` の基底を対象と"
"し, 一部のメソッドは `HatNot` に対して失敗します."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:105
msgid "BaseClass"
msgstr "BaseClass"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:107
msgid ""
"`BaseClass a` requires `Element a` and provides `compareBase :: a -> a -> "
"Ordering`, defaulting to `compareElement`. Built-in single-coordinate bases "
"include `AccountTitles`, `CountUnit`, `Text` (also called `Name`), `Day`, "
"and `TimeOfDay`. Tuples of 2 through 7 element types have `BaseClass` "
"instances even when individual coordinates have no separate `BaseClass` "
"instance."
msgstr ""
"`BaseClass a` は `Element a` を要求し, `compareBase :: a -> a -> Ordering` を"
"提供します. 既定の実装は `compareElement` です. 組み込みの単一座標の基底に"
"は, `AccountTitles`, `CountUnit`, `Text` (`Name` とも呼びます), `Day`, "
"`TimeOfDay` があります. 2 個から 7 個の要素の型のタプルは, 個々の座標が単"
"独では `BaseClass` の instance を持たなくても, `BaseClass` の instance を持ち"
"ます."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:109
msgid "HatBaseClass"
msgstr "HatBaseClass"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:111
msgid ""
"`HatBaseClass` requires `BaseClass` for both the whole hat base and its "
"`BasePart`, and `AxisDecompose` for `BasePart`. `AxisDecompose` supplies per-"
"axis keys; its generic and tuple instances cover the coordinates used in the "
"withdrawal."
msgstr ""
"`HatBaseClass` は hat 基底全体とその `BasePart` の両方に `BaseClass` を, "
"`BasePart` に `AxisDecompose` を要求します. `AxisDecompose` は軸ごとのキーを"
"提供します. その generic の instance とタプルの instance は, 引き出しで使う座"
"標に対応しています."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:113
msgid "Associated type or method"
msgstr "関連型またはメソッド"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:115
msgid "`BasePart a`"
msgstr "`BasePart a`"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:115
msgid ""
"The base type after removing the direction. For `HatBase a`, this is `a`."
msgstr "方向を取り除いた基底の型です. `HatBase a` の場合は `a` です."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:116
msgid "`base`, `hat`"
msgstr "`base`, `hat`"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:116
msgid "Extract the underlying base and direction."
msgstr "方向を付ける前の基底と方向を取り出します."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:117
msgid "`merge`"
msgstr "`merge`"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:117
msgid "Build a hat base from a direction and a base part."
msgstr "方向と基底部分から hat 基底を構築します."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:118
msgid "`toHat`, `toNot`"
msgstr "`toHat`, `toNot`"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:118
msgid "Set the direction while retaining the base."
msgstr "基底を保持して方向を設定します."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:119
msgid "`revHat`"
msgstr "`revHat`"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:119
msgid "Exchange `Hat` and `Not`."
msgstr "`Hat` と `Not` を入れ替えます."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:120
msgid "`isHat`, `isNot`"
msgstr "`isHat`, `isNot`"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:120
msgid "Test the direction."
msgstr "方向を判定します."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:121
msgid "`compareHatBase`"
msgstr "`compareHatBase`"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:121
msgid "Compare hat bases; its default is `compareBase`."
msgstr "hat 基底を比較します. 既定の実装は `compareBase` です."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:123
msgid ""
"A custom representation must implement `BasePart`, `base`, `hat`, `merge`, "
"`toHat`, `toNot`, `revHat`, `isHat`, and `isNot`. Reconstruction must "
"preserve coordinates and direction; reversal twice must restore a concrete "
"base. `HatBase a` already implements these operations. The bare `Hat` type "
"has an instance with the single-value `BaseForSingleHat` as its base part."
msgstr ""
"独自の表現では, `BasePart`, `base`, `hat`, `merge`, `toHat`, `toNot`, "
"`revHat`, `isHat`, `isNot` を実装する必要があります. 再構築は座標と方向を保持"
"しなければならず, 2 回の反転で具体的な基底が元に戻る必要があります. `HatBase "
"a` はこれらの演算をすでに実装しています. 単独の `Hat` 型には, 単一の値を持つ "
"`BaseForSingleHat` を基底部分とする instance があります."

#: src/algebra/values.md:3
msgid ""
"The January 10 withdrawal has two postings of 3,000 yen: cash increases, and "
"the savings deposit decreases. The amount is positive in both postings. The "
"decrease is represented by `Hat` on the deposit base, rather than by a "
"negative amount."
msgstr ""
"1 月 10 日の引き出しには, 現金の増加と普通預金の減少という, それぞれ 3,000 円"
"の 2 つの項 (posting) があります. どちらの項も金額は正です. 減少は負の金額で"
"はなく, 預金の基底に付けた `Hat` で表します."

#: src/algebra/values.md:5
msgid ""
"The value parameter of `Alg v b` represents these amounts, corresponding to "
"the [value domain of Definition 4](definitions.md#redundant-algebra-and-"
"linear-combinations). The example uses exchangealgebra-0.6.0.1 and the "
"[account-and-unit bases](bases.md#define-the-account-and-unit-bases)."
msgstr ""
"`Alg v b` の値パラメーターはこれらの金額を表し, [定義 4 の値域]"
"(definitions.md#redundant-algebra-and-linear-combinations)に対応します. この"
"例では exchangealgebra-0.6.0.1 と[勘定科目と単位の基底](bases.md#define-the-"
"account-and-unit-bases)を使います."

#: src/algebra/values.md:7
msgid "Choose an amount type"
msgstr "金額の型を選ぶ"

#: src/algebra/values.md:9
msgid ""
"Use `MoneyDecimal` for the withdrawal. Its decimal arithmetic represents "
"3,000 yen exactly, and addition of the posting amounts is exact. Axioms 4 "
"and 5 hold exactly when the amounts, intermediate sums, and products are "
"representable. The [numerical conditions on the axioms](definitions.md#five-"
"axioms) distinguish exact arithmetic from a rounded readout."
msgstr ""
"引き出しには `MoneyDecimal` を使ってください. その十進演算は 3,000 円を正確に"
"表し, 項の金額の加算も正確です. 金額と途中の和および積が表現可能な場合, 公理 "
"4 と 5 は厳密に成り立ちます. [公理の数値的条件](definitions.md#five-axioms)で"
"は, 正確な演算と丸めを伴う読み出しを区別しています."

#: src/algebra/values.md:11
msgid ""
"Save the code blocks in their displayed order as `Main.hs`. The setup "
"includes the unit declaration so that the program compiles on its own:"
msgstr ""
"コードブロックを表示順に `Main.hs` として保存してください. 準備部分には単位の"
"宣言も含まれているので, プログラムを単独でコンパイルできます:"

#: src/algebra/values.md:24
msgid "-- | Currency coordinates for the withdrawal.\n"
msgstr "-- | 引き出しの通貨の座標です.\n"

#: src/algebra/values.md:35
msgid "-- | The January 10 withdrawal, with exact decimal yen amounts.\n"
msgstr "-- | 正確な十進数の円金額による, 1 月 10 日の引き出しです.\n"

#: src/algebra/values.md:42
msgid ""
"`MoneyDecimal` has an integer mantissa and a scale of up to 255 decimal "
"places. A product is exact when representable; division can require "
"rounding. `bankersRound` explicitly rounds to a chosen number of decimal "
"places, with ties to even, when a monetary amount must be finalized."
msgstr ""
"`MoneyDecimal` は整数の仮数と最大 255 桁の小数桁数を持ちます. 表現可能な積は"
"正確ですが, 除算には丸めが必要な場合があります. 金額を確定する必要があるとき"
"は, `bankersRound` で指定した小数桁数へ明示的に丸めます. 端数がちょうど中間の"
"場合は偶数丸めになります."

#: src/algebra/values.md:44
msgid "Compare portions of the withdrawal"
msgstr "引き出しの一部を比較する"

#: src/algebra/values.md:46
msgid ""
"`MoneyDouble` wraps `Double`, with binary floating-point arithmetic and a "
"distinct amount type. The integer amount 3,000 is exact in both "
"`MoneyDecimal` and `MoneyDouble`. Differences arise when arithmetic uses "
"fractions that have no exact binary representation."
msgstr ""
"`MoneyDouble` は `Double` を包み, 二進浮動小数点演算を行う独立した金額の型で"
"す. 整数の金額 3,000 は `MoneyDecimal` と `MoneyDouble` のどちらでも正確で"
"す. 二進数で正確に表せない分数を演算に使うと, 違いが生じます."

#: src/algebra/values.md:48
msgid ""
"For example, allocate 10% and 20% portions of the withdrawal. These are "
"scaled examples of the same transaction, not additional cash movements. "
"Compare their combined posting total with the result of adding the two "
"ratios before scaling:"
msgstr ""
"例えば, 引き出しの 10% と 20% を配分します. これは同じ取引をスカラー倍した例"
"であり, 追加の現金移動ではありません. 両者の項の合計と, 2 つの比率を先に足し"
"てからスカラー倍した結果を比較してください:"

#: src/algebra/values.md:51
msgid "-- | The same withdrawal with binary floating-point amounts.\n"
msgstr "-- | 同じ引き出しを二進浮動小数点の金額で表します.\n"

#: src/algebra/values.md:55
msgid ""
"-- | Compare separate 10% and 20% portions with one combined 30% portion.\n"
msgstr "-- | 個別の 10% と 20% の配分を, 合わせた 30% の配分と比較します.\n"

#: src/algebra/values.md:60
msgid ""
"-- | Binary rounding can distinguish the two constructions of the portions.\n"
msgstr ""
"-- | 二進数の丸めにより, 配分の 2 つの構築方法で違いが生じる場合があります.\n"

#: src/algebra/values.md:67
msgid ""
"With exact decimal arithmetic, both computations give the same total. In "
"binary arithmetic, `0.1 + 0.2` is rounded before it is multiplied by the "
"withdrawal amounts. The output labels `Decimal portion totals (separate, "
"combined)` and `Binary portion totals (separate, combined)` identify the "
"comparison. The totals count both the cash and deposit postings, so a 30% "
"portion has a posting total of 1,800 yen, rather than a cash amount of 900 "
"yen."
msgstr ""
"正確な十進演算では, どちらの計算も同じ合計になります. 二進演算では, `0.1 + "
"0.2` が引き出しの金額に掛けられる前に丸められます. 出力ラベル `Decimal "
"portion totals (separate, combined)` と `Binary portion totals (separate, "
"combined)` が比較対象を示します. 合計には現金と預金の両方の項を数えるので, "
"30% の配分では項の合計が 1,800 円になります. 現金の金額 900 円とは異なります."

#: src/algebra/values.md:69
msgid ""
"For finite stored amounts, readouts such as `norm` sum exactly in an "
"accumulator and round once. This does not undo rounding already introduced "
"when constructing amounts or multiplying postings."
msgstr ""
"記録された金額が有限の場合, `norm` などの読み出しはアキュムレーター内で正確に"
"合計し, 1 回だけ丸めます. これによって, 金額の構築時や項の乗算時にすでに生じ"
"た丸めが元に戻るわけではありません."

#: src/algebra/values.md:71
msgid "Construction and scalar checks"
msgstr "構築時とスカラーの検査"

#: src/algebra/values.md:73
msgid ""
"A negative withdrawal amount would misrepresent the transaction: the "
"direction already belongs to the base. The value types can represent "
"negative numbers, but `.@` rejects a negative or non-finite amount. It "
"checks the direction first and rejects `HatNot` even for zero; a zero amount "
"with a concrete direction gives `Zero`."
msgstr ""
"引き出しの金額を負にすると, 取引を誤って表すことになります. 方向はすでに基底"
"が持っています. 値の型は負数を表現できますが, `.@` は負または非有限の金額を拒"
"否します. まず方向を検査し, ゼロであっても `HatNot` を拒否します. 具体的な方"
"向を持つゼロの金額は `Zero` になります."

#: src/algebra/values.md:75
msgid ""
"For scalar multiplication, any scalar times `Zero` gives `Zero`, and a zero "
"scalar times an algebra gives `Zero`. These shortcuts are processed before "
"scalar validation. A negative or non-finite scalar applied to a nonzero "
"algebra raises `error`. Finite floating-point inputs do not guarantee finite "
"products."
msgstr ""
"スカラー倍では, どのスカラーを `Zero` に掛けても `Zero` になり, ゼロのスカ"
"ラーを代数に掛けても `Zero` になります. これらの簡約はスカラーの検証前に処理"
"されます. ゼロでない代数に負または非有限のスカラーを適用すると, `error` が発"
"生します. 有限の浮動小数点入力でも, 積が有限になる保証はありません."

#: src/algebra/values.md:77
msgid ""
"Catch the documented construction errors in the example so that the program "
"can report every check:"
msgstr ""
"プログラムがすべての検査を報告できるように, 例の中で文書に記載された構築エ"
"ラーを捕捉してください:"

#: src/algebra/values.md:80
msgid "-- | Report whether construction raises the documented ErrorCall.\n"
msgstr "-- | 構築時に文書に記載された ErrorCall が発生するかを報告します.\n"

#: src/algebra/values.md:90
msgid ""
"Application code must validate external amounts before constructing postings."
msgstr ""
"アプリケーションコードでは, 項を構築する前に外部からの金額を検証する必要があ"
"ります."

#: src/algebra/values.md:94
msgid "Declare a custom yen amount type"
msgstr "独自の円金額の型を宣言する"

#: src/algebra/values.md:96
msgid ""
"A custom value type requires its own validation and accumulator operations. "
"`YenAmount` represents rational yen amounts, so even a fractional allocation "
"such as one seventh is exact. The accumulator can hold signed differences "
"internally, while negative values remain invalid as postings. The default "
"`postingUpperBound` is appropriate because rational amounts have no "
"magnitude bound and no NaN or infinities."
msgstr ""
"独自の値の型には, その型固有の検証とアキュムレーターの演算が必要です. "
"`YenAmount` は有理数の円金額を表すので, 7 分の 1 のような分数による配分も正確"
"です. アキュムレーターは内部で符号付きの差を保持できますが, 項として負の値は"
"無効のままです. 有理数の金額には大きさの上限がなく, NaN も無限大もないので, "
"既定の `postingUpperBound` が適しています."

#: src/algebra/values.md:99
msgid ""
"-- | Yen amounts with exact rational arithmetic; negative values cannot be "
"posted.\n"
msgstr "-- | 正確な有理数演算による円金額です. 負の値は項にできません.\n"

#: src/algebra/values.md:106
msgid ""
"-- The accumulator may be signed even though postings must be nonnegative.\n"
msgstr "-- 項は非負でなければなりませんが, アキュムレーターは符号を持てます.\n"

#: src/algebra/values.md:137
msgid "Run the amount checks"
msgstr "金額の検査を実行する"

#: src/algebra/values.md:139
msgid ""
"Print the withdrawal with each value type, compare the portions, and check "
"the invalid inputs and zero shortcuts. The rational instance prints integer "
"amounts as `3000 % 1` inside the algebra."
msgstr ""
"各値の型で引き出しを表示し, 配分を比較して, 無効な入力とゼロによる簡約を検査"
"してください. 有理数の instance は, 代数の中で整数の金額を `3000 % 1` と表示"
"します."

#: src/algebra/values.md:145
msgid ""
"-- | Print the withdrawal, allocation comparisons, and named validity "
"checks.\n"
msgstr "-- | 引き出し, 配分の比較, 名前付きの妥当性検査を表示します.\n"

#: src/algebra/values.md:149
msgid "\"Decimal withdrawal\""
msgstr "\"Decimal withdrawal\""

#: src/algebra/values.md:150
msgid "\"Binary withdrawal\""
msgstr "\"Binary withdrawal\""

#: src/algebra/values.md:151
msgid "\"Decimal portion totals (separate, combined)\""
msgstr "\"Decimal portion totals (separate, combined)\""

#: src/algebra/values.md:152
msgid "\"Binary portion totals (separate, combined)\""
msgstr "\"Binary portion totals (separate, combined)\""

#: src/algebra/values.md:153
msgid "\"Rational yen withdrawal\""
msgstr "\"Rational yen withdrawal\""

#: src/algebra/values.md:156
msgid "\"Negative amount rejected\""
msgstr "\"Negative amount rejected\""

#: src/algebra/values.md:157
msgid "\"Infinite amount rejected\""
msgstr "\"Infinite amount rejected\""

#: src/algebra/values.md:158
msgid "\"NaN amount rejected\""
msgstr "\"NaN amount rejected\""

#: src/algebra/values.md:159
msgid "\"Wildcard side rejected\""
msgstr "\"Wildcard side rejected\""

#: src/algebra/values.md:160
msgid "\"Negative scalar rejected\""
msgstr "\"Negative scalar rejected\""

#: src/algebra/values.md:161
msgid "\"Infinite scalar rejected\""
msgstr "\"Infinite scalar rejected\""

#: src/algebra/values.md:162
msgid "\"NaN scalar rejected\""
msgstr "\"NaN scalar rejected\""

#: src/algebra/values.md:163
msgid "\"Negative scalar times Zero\""
msgstr "\"Negative scalar times Zero\""

#: src/algebra/values.md:165
msgid "\"Zero scalar times withdrawal\""
msgstr "\"Zero scalar times withdrawal\""

#: src/algebra/values.md:187
msgid ""
"Each rejection result names its input condition. `Negative scalar times "
"Zero` and `Zero scalar times withdrawal` report the zero shortcuts, rather "
"than rejected inputs."
msgstr ""
"拒否の結果にはそれぞれ入力条件の名前が付いています. `Negative scalar times "
"Zero` と `Zero scalar times withdrawal` は, 入力の拒否ではなくゼロによる簡約"
"を報告します."

#: src/algebra/values.md:191
msgid "HatVal methods and laws"
msgstr "HatVal のメソッドと法則"

#: src/algebra/values.md:193
msgid ""
"`HatVal` requires `Show`, `Ord`, `Eq`, `Nearly`, `Fractional`, and `Num`. "
"Built-in instances include `MoneyDecimal`, `MoneyDouble`, and bare `Double`."
msgstr ""
"`HatVal` は `Show`, `Ord`, `Eq`, `Nearly`, `Fractional`, `Num` を要求します. "
"組み込みの instance には `MoneyDecimal`, `MoneyDouble`, 単独の `Double` があ"
"ります."

#: src/algebra/values.md:195
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "メソッド"

#: src/algebra/values.md:197
msgid "`zeroValue`, `isZeroValue`"
msgstr "`zeroValue`, `isZeroValue`"

#: src/algebra/values.md:197
msgid "Define zero and test it. `isZeroValue` has an equality-based default."
msgstr ""
"ゼロを定義し, ゼロかどうかを判定します. `isZeroValue` は等値比較に基づく既定"
"の実装を持ちます."

#: src/algebra/values.md:198
msgid "`valueError`"
msgstr "`valueError`"

#: src/algebra/values.md:198
msgid ""
"Return `Nothing` for a finite nonnegative value, `Just NegativeValue` for a "
"negative finite value, or `Just NonFiniteValue` for NaN or either infinity."
msgstr ""
"有限の非負値には `Nothing`, 有限の負値には `Just NegativeValue`, NaN またはい"
"ずれかの無限大には `Just NonFiniteValue` を返します."

#: src/algebra/values.md:199
msgid "`postingUpperBound`"
msgstr "`postingUpperBound`"

#: src/algebra/values.md:199
msgid ""
"An optional bound used by checked posting construction. Its default is "
"`Nothing`; the floating-point instances use a bound of 2^900."
msgstr ""
"検査付きで項を構築するときに使う, 任意の上限です. 既定値は `Nothing` です. 浮"
"動小数点の instance は 2^900 を上限に使います."

#: src/algebra/values.md:200
msgid "`showValue`"
msgstr "`showValue`"

#: src/algebra/values.md:200
msgid ""
"Render an amount inside the algebra's `Show` output. Decimal amounts retain "
"decimal formatting; floating-point amounts use the instance's formatting."
msgstr ""
"代数の `Show` 出力の中で金額を表示します. 十進数の金額は十進数の書式を保持"
"し, 浮動小数点の金額はその instance の書式を使います."

#: src/algebra/values.md:201
msgid "Associated data family `Accum n`"
msgstr "関連データ族 `Accum n`"

#: src/algebra/values.md:201
msgid ""
"Represent an exact signed sum, including special states if the value type "
"has NaN or infinities."
msgstr ""
"正確な符号付きの和を表します. 値の型が NaN または無限大を持つ場合は, その特殊"
"な状態も含みます."

#: src/algebra/values.md:202
msgid "`emptyAccum`, `addAccum`, `mergeAccum`, `negateAccum`"
msgstr "`emptyAccum`, `addAccum`, `mergeAccum`, `negateAccum`"

#: src/algebra/values.md:202
msgid "Construct and combine exact sums and differences."
msgstr "正確な和と差を構築し, 結合します."

#: src/algebra/values.md:203
msgid "`signAccum`, `roundAccum`, `exactAccum`"
msgstr "`signAccum`, `roundAccum`, `exactAccum`"

#: src/algebra/values.md:203
msgid ""
"Observe the sign, round once to an amount, or read a finite sum as a "
"`Rational`."
msgstr ""
"符号の観測, 金額への 1 回の丸め, または有限の和の `Rational` としての読み出し"
"を行います."

#: src/algebra/values.md:204
msgid "`splitAccum`"
msgstr "`splitAccum`"

#: src/algebra/values.md:204
msgid ""
"Split a positive exact sum into positive finite amounts with that same exact "
"total. Return `Nothing` for nonpositive or non-finite states, or when the "
"rounded total is infinite."
msgstr ""
"正確な正の和を, 正確な合計が同じになる正の有限な金額に分割します. 正でない状"
"態や非有限の状態, または丸めた合計が無限大になる場合には `Nothing` を返しま"
"す."

#: src/algebra/values.md:205
msgid "`roundRational`"
msgstr "`roundRational`"

#: src/algebra/values.md:205
msgid ""
"Convert a rational using `Nearest` or `ToMultipleOf unit`, returning "
"`Nothing` when the requested conversion is unavailable."
msgstr ""
"`Nearest` または `ToMultipleOf unit` を使って有理数を変換し, 要求された変換が"
"できない場合は `Nothing` を返します."

#: src/algebra/values.md:207
msgid ""
"`isErrorValue` is derived from `valueError`; it is not a method to implement "
"independently. An exact decimal instance returns `Nothing` for "
"`roundRational Nearest` when the rational has no representable exact decimal "
"value. Floating-point instances round to the nearest representable value and "
"do not support `ToMultipleOf`."
msgstr ""
"`isErrorValue` は `valueError` から導出されるので, 独立して実装するメソッドで"
"はありません. 正確な十進数の instance は, 有理数に対して表現可能な正確な十進"
"値がない場合, `roundRational Nearest` に対して `Nothing` を返します. 浮動小数"
"点の instance は最も近い表現可能な値に丸め, `ToMultipleOf` には対応していませ"
"ん."

#: src/algebra/values.md:209
msgid ""
"An accumulator must merge associatively and commutatively with zero as its "
"unit, preserve exact finite sums, and support exact subtraction through "
"negation. Accumulating and rounding a single finite value must preserve that "
"value. `splitAccum` must depend on the total, preserve it exactly, and "
"succeed for every positive finite state with a finite rounded result. If the "
"type represents NaN or infinities, accumulation of those values must follow "
"IEEE addition. Value validation and ties-to-even rounding are also part of "
"the instance contract."
msgstr ""
"アキュムレーターは, ゼロを単位元として結合的かつ可換的に結合でき, 正確な有限"
"和を保持し, 符号反転による正確な減算に対応する必要があります. 単一の有限値を"
"累積して丸めても, その値を保持しなければなりません. `splitAccum` は合計だけに"
"依存し, その合計を正確に保持し, 丸めた結果が有限になるすべての正の有限状態で"
"成功する必要があります. 型が NaN または無限大を表す場合, それらの値の累積は "
"IEEE の加算に従う必要があります. 値の検証と偶数丸めも instance の契約の一部で"
"す."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:3
msgid ""
"The January 10 withdrawal becomes one algebra value containing two postings: "
"a 3,000-yen increase in cash and a 3,000-yen decrease in savings deposits. "
"Additional transactions in the same month can be added to this value while "
"retaining their separate amounts."
msgstr ""
"1 月 10 日の引き出しは, 現金の 3,000 円の増加と普通預金の 3,000 円の減少とい"
"う 2 つの項 (posting) を含む, 1 つの代数の値になります. 同じ月の他の取引も, "
"それぞれの金額を保持したままこの値に加えられます."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:5
msgid ""
"`Alg v b` represents a finite collection of postings with amount type `v` "
"and hat base type `b`. The withdrawal uses `MoneyDecimal` amounts and "
"`HatBase (AccountTitles, Unit)` bases in exchangealgebra-0.6.0.1. The "
"collection corresponds to [Definitions 4 and 5](definitions.md#redundant-"
"algebra-and-linear-combinations); its operations correspond to [Definition 6]"
"(definitions.md#operations)."
msgstr ""
"`Alg v b` は, 金額の型 `v` と hat 基底の型 `b` を持つ項の有限な集まりを表しま"
"す. 引き出しでは, exchangealgebra-0.6.0.1 の `MoneyDecimal` の金額と "
"`HatBase (AccountTitles, Unit)` の基底を使います. この集まりは[定義 4 と 5]"
"(definitions.md#redundant-algebra-and-linear-combinations)に対応し, その演算"
"は[定義 6](definitions.md#operations)に対応します."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:7
msgid "Construct postings and add them"
msgstr "項を構築して加算する"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:9
msgid ""
"Keep the custom currency declaration so the example is a standalone program. "
"Save the code blocks in their displayed order as `Main.hs`:"
msgstr ""
"例を単独で実行できるプログラムにするため, 独自の通貨の宣言を残してください. "
"コードブロックを表示順に `Main.hs` として保存してください:"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:30
msgid ""
"Attach an amount to each base with `.@`, and add the postings with `.+`:"
msgstr "`.@` で各基底に金額を付け, `.+` で項を加算してください:"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:33 src/exchange/exchange.md:45
#: src/exchange/transfer.md:39 src/journal/journal.md:67
msgid ""
"-- | January 10: withdraw 3,000 yen from Bank A's savings account into "
"cash.\n"
msgstr "-- | 1 月 10 日: A 銀行の普通預金から 3,000 円を現金で引き出します.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:39
msgid ""
"The base with `Not` records the cash increase; the base with `Hat` records "
"the deposit decrease. Both amounts are positive. `norm withdrawal` is 6,000 "
"yen because it counts both postings, even though the cash withdrawn is 3,000 "
"yen. `2 .* withdrawal` doubles each posting, without changing its account, "
"currency, or direction."
msgstr ""
"`Not` を持つ基底は現金の増加を記録し, `Hat` を持つ基底は預金の減少を記録しま"
"す. どちらの金額も正です. 引き出した現金は 3,000 円ですが, `norm withdrawal` "
"は両方の項を数えるので 6,000 円です. `2 .* withdrawal` は, 勘定科目, 通貨, 方"
"向を変えずに各項を 2 倍にします."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:41
msgid "Add the month's transactions"
msgstr "月内の取引を加える"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:43
msgid ""
"Suppose the business withdraws another 2,000 yen on January 15, buys goods "
"for 500 yen in cash on January 20, and exchanges 1,500 yen in cash for 10 "
"dollars on January 25. The exchange has no fee and uses 150 yen per dollar. "
"Record each transaction and add it to the month:"
msgstr ""
"事業者が 1 月 15 日にさらに 2,000 円を引き出し, 1 月 20 日に現金 500 円で商品"
"を購入し, 1 月 25 日に現金 1,500 円を 10 ドルに両替するとします. 両替に手数料"
"はなく, 1 ドルを 150 円とします. 各取引を記録し, 月の記録に加えてください:"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:46 src/journal/journal.md:71
msgid "-- | January 15: withdraw another 2,000 yen.\n"
msgstr "-- | 1 月 15 日: さらに 2,000 円を引き出します.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:50
msgid ""
"-- | January 20: buy goods for 500 yen in cash, recorded as Purchases.\n"
msgstr "-- | 1 月 20 日: 現金 500 円で商品を購入し, Purchases に記録します.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:55
msgid ""
"-- | January 25: exchange 1,500 yen in cash for 10 dollars, with no fee.\n"
msgstr "-- | 1 月 25 日: 手数料なしで現金 1,500 円を 10 ドルに両替します.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:60
msgid "-- | Changes recorded during the month, with no opening balances.\n"
msgstr "-- | 期首残高を含まない, 月内に記録された変化です.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:66
msgid ""
"`month` contains the recorded changes without opening balances. Adding the "
"withdrawals with `.+` retains the cash increases of 3,000 and 2,000 as "
"separate amounts on `(Cash, Yen)`. The cash payment and currency exchange "
"also retain separate decreases on that base. No implicit sum or cancellation "
"occurs at a shared base."
msgstr ""
"`month` は期首残高を含まず, 記録された変化を含みます. `.+` で引き出しを加算す"
"ると, `(Cash, Yen)` 上の現金増加 3,000 と 2,000 は別々の金額として保持されま"
"す. 現金払いと両替による減少も, その基底上で別々に保持されます. 同じ基底上で"
"も, 暗黙の合算や相殺は行われません."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:68
msgid ""
"The payment uses `Purchases` for the goods purchased. The exchange reduces "
"yen cash and increases dollar cash; the two currencies remain separate "
"coordinates. The record omits date and bank-account axes because its "
"balances combine dates and do not distinguish bank accounts."
msgstr ""
"支払いでは購入した商品に `Purchases` を使います. 両替は円の現金を減らし, ドル"
"の現金を増やします. 2 つの通貨は別々の座標として保持されます. この記録の残高"
"は日付をまたいで合算し, 銀行口座を区別しないので, 日付と銀行口座の軸は省略し"
"ています."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:70
msgid "Select an operation"
msgstr "演算を選ぶ"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:72
msgid ""
"**What cash remains in each currency?** Apply `bar` to net the changes "
"within each full base, then `proj` to select Cash without restricting the "
"unit. The yen cash change is 3,000 + 2,000 - 500 - 1,500 = 3,000 yen, and "
"the dollar cash change is 10 dollars. These are balances of the recorded "
"changes; the yen deposit decrease also requires an opening balance to "
"determine the deposit still held."
msgstr ""
"**各通貨の現金はいくら残りますか?** `bar` を適用して完全な基底ごとに変化を相"
"殺し, 次に `proj` で単位を制限せずに Cash を選択してください. 円の現金の変化"
"は 3,000 + 2,000 - 500 - 1,500 = 3,000 円で, ドルの現金の変化は 10 ドルです. "
"これらは記録された変化の残高です. 円の預金の減少についても, 残っている預金を"
"求めるには期首残高が必要です."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:74
msgid ""
"**What is the total of the yen postings?** Select all yen bases with `proj`, "
"then apply `norm`. This measures gross posted amounts, counting both "
"directions and both accounts of the withdrawals. It is not a net cash flow. "
"Select a unit before totaling: adding yen and dollar amounts without "
"conversion does not produce a monetary total in either currency."
msgstr ""
"**円の項の合計はいくらですか?** `proj` ですべての円の基底を選択し, 次に "
"`norm` を適用してください. これは記録された金額の総額を測り, 引き出しの両方向"
"と両勘定科目を数えます. 純キャッシュフローではありません. 合計する前に単位を"
"選択してください. 換算せずに円とドルの金額を足しても, どちらの通貨建ての金額"
"の合計としても意味を持ちません."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:76
msgid ""
"**Which cash changes were recorded in yen?** Select `(Cash, Yen)` without "
"applying bar. The original posting amounts remain available in the selected "
"algebra."
msgstr ""
"**円で記録された現金の変化はどれですか?** bar を適用せずに `(Cash, Yen)` を選"
"択してください. 選択された代数には, 元の項の金額が保持されます."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:79
msgid ""
"-- | Remaining cash by currency after canceling changes within each full "
"base.\n"
msgstr "-- | 完全な基底ごとに変化を相殺した後の, 通貨別の現金残高です.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:82
msgid "-- | Original yen postings on every account and in both directions.\n"
msgstr "-- | すべての勘定科目と両方向にわたる, 元の円の項です.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:86
msgid "-- | Original cash postings in yen, before aggregation.\n"
msgstr "-- | 集約前の, 円建ての現金の項です.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:92
msgid ""
"The query `HatNot :< (Cash, (.#))` restricts the account but leaves "
"direction and currency unrestricted. `HatNot :< ((.#), Yen)` restricts the "
"currency but leaves account and direction unrestricted. A query wildcard "
"matches any stored coordinate; a concrete coordinate does not match a stored "
"wildcard, as in [Query coordinates and combine axes](elements.md#query-"
"coordinates-and-combine-axes)."
msgstr ""
"問い合わせ `HatNot :< (Cash, (.#))` は勘定科目を制限し, 方向と通貨は制限しま"
"せん. `HatNot :< ((.#), Yen)` は通貨を制限し, 勘定科目と方向は制限しません. "
"[座標を問い合わせて軸を組み合わせる](elements.md#query-coordinates-and-"
"combine-axes)と同様に, 問い合わせの wildcard は記録されたどの座標にも一致しま"
"すが, 具体的な座標は記録された wildcard に一致しません."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:94
msgid ""
"**What are the cash increases and decreases separately?** `compress "
"yenCashPostings` totals each direction independently. It gives an increase "
"total of 5,000 yen and a decrease total of 2,000 yen. `bar` instead cancels "
"the totals and leaves the increase of 3,000 yen. Both operations explicitly "
"discard individual posting detail."
msgstr ""
"**現金の増加と減少はそれぞれいくらですか?** `compress yenCashPostings` は各方"
"向を個別に合計します. 増加の合計は 5,000 円, 減少の合計は 2,000 円になりま"
"す. 一方, `bar` は両者の合計を相殺し, 3,000 円の増加を残します. どちらの演算"
"も個々の項の明細を明示的に捨てます."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:96
msgid ""
"**What reverses the withdrawal?** `(.^) withdrawal` changes the cash "
"increase into a decrease and the deposit decrease into an increase. Every "
"amount remains 3,000. Adding this value to `withdrawal` keeps both sets of "
"postings; applying `bar` to the sum gives zero. Hat is an involution on "
"direction, not arithmetic negation."
msgstr ""
"**引き出しを逆転させるにはどうしますか?** `(.^) withdrawal` は現金の増加を減"
"少に, 預金の減少を増加に変えます. 各金額は 3,000 のままです. この値を "
"`withdrawal` に加えると, 両方の項の集まりが保持されます. 和に `bar` を適用す"
"るとゼロになります. Hat は方向に関する対合であり, 算術的な符号反転ではありま"
"せん."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:98
msgid "Run the queries"
msgstr "問い合わせを実行する"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:100
