"Run `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o exchange-example`, then run "
"`./exchange-example` in your project directory. The program prints:"
msgstr ""
"プロジェクトのディレクトリで `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o "
"exchange-example` を実行し, 続いて `./exchange-example` を実行してください. "
