#: src/exchange/exchange.md:94
msgid ""
"`Debit postings` contains the cash increase; `Credit postings` contains the "
"deposit decrease. Each side totals 3,000 yen, and `balance withdrawal` is "
"`True`. `diffRL` returns the neutral `Side` and zero when the exact "
"difference is zero. Balanced amounts alone do not establish that the "
"accounts or the transaction are correct."
msgstr ""
"`Debit postings` には現金の増加, `Credit postings` には預金の減少が含まれま"
"す. 各側の合計は 3,000 円で, `balance withdrawal` は `True` です. 厳密な差が"
"ゼロのとき, `diffRL` は中立の `Side` とゼロを返します. 金額が均衡するだけで"
"は, 勘定科目や取引が正しいとは確認できません."

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:96
msgid ""
"`whatDiv` reports the account division; `whichSide` includes the posting's "
"direction. `whatPIMO` classifies the ordinary cash account as `PS`, or plus "
"stock, and `fixedCurrent` classifies it as `Current`. PIMO classifies the "
"account's role; the direction still distinguishes its increase from its "
"decrease."
msgstr ""
"`whatDiv` は勘定の区分を返し, `whichSide` は項の方向も考慮します. `whatPIMO` "
"は通常の現金勘定をストック増加を表す `PS` に分類し, `fixedCurrent` は "
"`Current` に分類します. PIMO は勘定の役割を分類します. 増加と減少は引き続き方"
"向で区別します."

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:98
msgid ""
"Select or convert to one monetary unit before comparing totals. The yen-"
"dollar exchange in [Add the month's transactions](../algebra/"
"redundant.md#add-the-months-transactions) records quantities in different "
"currencies. Its raw amounts do not have a common unit for a balance "
"comparison."
msgstr ""
"合計を比べる前に, 1 つの通貨単位を選ぶか単位を換算してください. [月の取引を加"
"える](../algebra/redundant.md#add-the-months-transactions)で扱った円とドルの"
"交換は, 異なる通貨の数量を記録しています. 換算前の額には, 貸借を比較するため"
"の共通単位がありません."

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:104
msgid "Class or operation"
msgstr "クラスまたは演算"

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:106
msgid "`ExBaseClass`"
msgstr "`ExBaseClass`"

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:106
msgid ""
"A `HatBaseClass` base with account access. Implement `getAccountTitle` and "
"`setAccountTitle`; the setter must retain the other coordinates and "
"direction."
msgstr ""
"勘定科目へのアクセスを備えた `HatBaseClass` の基底です. `getAccountTitle` と "
"`setAccountTitle` を実装してください. setter は他の座標と方向を保持する必要が"
"あります."

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:107
msgid "`whatDiv`, `isContra`, `whatPIMO`, `fixedCurrent`"
msgstr "`whatDiv`, `isContra`, `whatPIMO`, `fixedCurrent`"

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:107
msgid ""
"Classify an account from its base. The defaults use the account registry."
msgstr ""
"基底から勘定科目を分類します. 既定の実装は勘定科目レジストリを使います."

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:108
msgid "`whichSide`"
msgstr "`whichSide`"

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:108
msgid ""
"Return the posting side from account classification and `Hat` or `Not`. A "
"query direction `HatNot` causes an error."
msgstr ""
"勘定科目の区分と `Hat` または `Not` から項の貸借の側を返します. 問い合わせ用"
"の方向 `HatNot` はエラーになります."

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:109
msgid "`decL`, `decR`"
msgstr "`decL`, `decR`"

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:109
msgid ""
"Select debit (left) or credit (right) postings without changing their "
"amounts or aggregating them."
msgstr "借方 (左) または貸方 (右) の項を選びます. 額の変更や集約は行いません."

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:110
msgid "`decP`, `decM`"
msgstr "`decP`, `decM`"

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:110
msgid ""
"`decP` selects `Hat` postings; `decM` selects `Not` postings. These "
"directions are distinct from debit and credit."
msgstr ""
"`decP` は `Hat` の項を選び, `decM` は `Not` の項を選びます. これらの方向は借"
"方と貸方とは異なります."

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:111
msgid "`balance`"
msgstr "`balance`"

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:111
msgid ""
"Compare exact debit and credit sums before rounding, without a tolerance. "
"Return `False` for non-finite postings."
msgstr ""
"許容誤差を使わず, 丸める前の厳密な借方と貸方の合計を比べます. 非有限の項があ"
"れば `False` を返します."

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:112
msgid "`diffRL`"
msgstr "`diffRL`"

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:112
msgid ""
"Return the side with the greater exact sum and the difference rounded once; "
"return `(Side, 0)` for exact equality."
msgstr ""
"厳密な合計が大きい側と, 1 回だけ丸めた差額を返します. 厳密に一致するときは "
"`(Side, 0)` を返します."

#: src/exchange/exchange.md:114
msgid ""
"`Exchange Alg v b` is provided for a `HatVal` amount type and an "
"`ExBaseClass` base. `Exchange (Journal n) v b` is provided when the note "
"type also satisfies `Note`."
msgstr ""
"`HatVal` の値型と `ExBaseClass` の基底に対して `Exchange Alg v b` が用意され"
"ています. 摘要 (note) の型が `Note` も満たす場合は `Exchange (Journal n) v "
"b` が用意されています."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:3
msgid ""
"A transfer moves an amount from one account to another by adding a journal "
"entry. Keep the January 10 withdrawal and suppose that the business pays "
"1,200 yen in cash on January 30 for January and February rent, 600 yen for "
"each month. If the payment was initially recorded entirely as rent expense, "
"defer February's 600 yen to prepaid expenses at January 31."
msgstr ""
"振替は仕訳を加えることで勘定科目間の額を付け替えます. 1 月 10 日の引き出しを"
"保ち, 1 月 30 日に 1 月分と 2 月分の家賃を各 600 円, 計 1,200 円, 現金で支"
"払ったとします. 当初は全額を支払家賃に計上した場合, 1 月 31 日に 2 月分の "
"600 円を前払費用へ振り替えます."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:5
msgid ""
"Use exchangealgebra-0.6.0.1 in the project prepared in [Add the package to a "
"Stack project](../usage/installation.md#add-the-package-to-a-stack-project). "
"The example extends [Record the withdrawal](exchange.md#record-the-"
"withdrawal) with the rent payment and its transfer entry. It uses the "
"accounting transfer API from `ExchangeAlgebra.Accounting.Transfer`, re-"
"exported by `ExchangeAlgebra`."
msgstr ""
"[Stack プロジェクトにパッケージを追加する](../usage/installation.md#add-the-"
"package-to-a-stack-project)に従い, exchangealgebra-0.6.0.1 を使ってください. "
"例では[引き出しを記録する](exchange.md#record-the-withdrawal)に家賃の支払と振"
"替仕訳を加えます. `ExchangeAlgebra` から再公開される "
"`ExchangeAlgebra.Accounting.Transfer` の会計用振替 API を使います."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:7
msgid "Record the rent payment"
msgstr "家賃の支払を記録する"

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:9
msgid ""
"Save the code blocks in their displayed order as `Main.hs`. Retain the "
"account-and-unit base and its instance:"
msgstr ""
"コードブロックを表示順に `Main.hs` として保存してください. 勘定科目と単位の基"
"底, および instance を保ってください:"

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:36
msgid "Add the payment to the withdrawal:"
msgstr "引き出しに支払を加えてください:"

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:43
msgid ""
"-- | January 30: pay 1,200 yen for January and February rent, initially "
"expensed.\n"
msgstr ""
"-- | 1 月 30 日: 1 月と 2 月の家賃 1,200 円を支払い, 当初は費用に計上しま"
"す.\n"

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:48
msgid "-- | Recorded changes before deferring the February share of rent.\n"
msgstr "-- | 2 月分の家賃を繰り延べる前に, どれだけ変化したかを記録します.\n"

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:54
msgid ""
"The payment debits RentExpense and credits Cash by 1,200 yen. The withdrawal "
"supplies the cash for the payment. `beforeTransfer` records changes without "
"opening balances; the deposit decrease requires an opening deposit to "
"determine the amount still held."
msgstr ""
"支払は借方に RentExpense, 貸方に Cash を各 1,200 円記録します. 引き出した現金"
"から支払います. `beforeTransfer` は期首残高を含めずに変化を記録します. 預金の"
"減少から残高を求めるには期首預金が必要です."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:56
msgid "Specify the source, amount rule, and destination"
msgstr "振替元, 額の規則, 振替先を指定する"

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:58
msgid ""
"[Definition 9](../algebra/definitions.md#transfers) describes a transfer by "
"a triple: the source base, the destination base, and a value transformation. "
"For the rent adjustment, the source is RentExpense, the transformation takes "
"one half of its balance, and the destination is PrepaidExpenses."
msgstr ""
"[定義 9](../algebra/definitions.md#transfers)は振替を, 振替元の基底, 振替先の"
"基底, 値の変換という三つ組で記述します. 家賃の調整では振替元が RentExpense, "
"変換が残高の半分を取る操作, 振替先が PrepaidExpenses です."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:60
msgid "Construct the table with `mkTransferTable`:"
msgstr "`mkTransferTable` で表を構築してください:"

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:63
msgid ""
"-- | Move half the rent balance to prepaid expenses, retaining its "
"currency.\n"
msgstr "-- | 通貨を保ち, 家賃の残高の半分を前払費用へ振り替えます.\n"

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:70
msgid ""
"Write `from .-> to |% share` to specify the source, destination, and share. "
"In 0.6.0.1 the accounting API uses whole balances (`Relabel`) or rational "
"shares (`Portion`), rather than an arbitrary function. `Portion 1 2` moves "
"half of the exact source balance, rounded once with the default `Nearest` "
"rule. The integer amounts in this example require no rounding."
msgstr ""
"`from .-> to |% share` と書いて振替元, 振替先, 割合を指定してください. "
"0.6.0.1 の会計 API は任意の関数ではなく, 残高全体 (`Relabel`) または有理数の"
"割合 (`Portion`) を使います. `Portion 1 2` は厳密な振替元残高の半分を振り替"
"え, 既定の `Nearest` 規則で 1 回だけ丸めます. この例の整数額には丸めは必要あ"
"りません."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:72
msgid ""
"The amount to transfer is computed from the net balance at each selected "
"full base. At the destination, the debit or credit side of that balance is "
"retained; the direction depends on the destination account's home side. The "
"returned entry contains a source cancellation and a destination posting. Add "
"both postings to the original record to retain its history."
msgstr ""
"振替額は, 選択した完全な基底ごとに正味残高から求めます. 振替先ではその残高が"
"借方か貸方かを保ちます. 方向は, 振替先の勘定科目で本来の貸借の側がどちらかに"
"よって決まります. 返される仕訳には, 振替元を取り消す項と振替先の項が含まれま"
"す. 両項を元の記録に加えて履歴を保持してください."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:74
msgid ""
"The source wildcard in `(RentExpense, (.#))` selects every currency "
"coordinate. The destination wildcard in `(PrepaidExpenses, (.#))` retains "
"the selected currency. Here the selected amount is in yen, so the "
"destination is `(PrepaidExpenses, Yen)`. A destination wildcard does not "
"replace yen with an inapplicable coordinate."
msgstr ""
"振替元 `(RentExpense, (.#))` の wildcard は全ての通貨座標を選びます. 振替先 "
"`(PrepaidExpenses, (.#))` の wildcard は選んだ通貨を保ちます. ここでは額が円"
"なので, 振替先は `(PrepaidExpenses, Yen)` です. 振替先の wildcard は円を該当"
"なしの座標に置き換えません."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:76
msgid "Add the transfer entry and read the balances"
msgstr "振替仕訳を加えて残高を読む"

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:78
msgid ""
"Apply the table, handle a rejected table or transfer, and add the returned "
"entry to the original record:"
msgstr ""
"表を適用し, 表や振替が拒否された場合を処理して, 返された仕訳を元の記録へ加え"
"てください:"

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:84
msgid ""
"-- | Generate and retain the adjusting entry, then inspect the net "
"balances.\n"
msgstr "-- | 整理仕訳を生成して保持し, 相殺後の残高を調べます.\n"

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:92
msgid "\"Rent payment\""
msgstr "\"Rent payment\""

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:93
msgid "\"Additional transfer entry\""
msgstr "\"Additional transfer entry\""

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:94
msgid "\"Transfer entry is balanced\""
msgstr "\"Transfer entry is balanced\""

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:95
msgid "\"Record retaining original and added postings\""
msgstr "\"Record retaining original and added postings\""

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:96
msgid "\"Balances after transfer\""
msgstr "\"Balances after transfer\""

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:97
msgid "\"Record is balanced\""
msgstr "\"Record is balanced\""

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:100
msgid ""
"Run `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o transfer-example`, then run "
"`./transfer-example` in your project directory. The program prints:"
msgstr ""
"プロジェクトのディレクトリで `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o "
"transfer-example` を実行し, 続いて `./transfer-example` を実行してください. "
"プログラムは次を出力します:"

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:111
msgid ""
"`Additional transfer entry` credits RentExpense by 600 yen and debits "
"PrepaidExpenses by 600 yen. Both accounts have debit home sides, so the "
"source cancellation uses `Hat` and the destination uses `Not`. The transfer "
"entry is balanced independently of the original record."
msgstr ""
"`Additional transfer entry` は貸方に RentExpense 600 円, 借方に "
"PrepaidExpenses 600 円を記録します. 両勘定科目とも本来の貸借の側が借方なの"
"で, 振替元の取消しは `Hat`, 振替先は `Not` を使います. 振替仕訳は元の記録とは"
"独立に均衡します."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:113
msgid ""
"The record made with `beforeTransfer .+ additions` retains the original "
"1,200-yen expense and the added 600-yen decrease. No implicit bar is applied "
"to that record. For `Balances after transfer`, apply `bar` to the combined "
"record: rent expense is 600 yen, prepaid expenses are 600 yen, cash has "
"increased by 1,800 yen, and deposits have decreased by 3,000 yen. The "
"transfer changes the classification of the payment while preserving cash, "
"deposits, currency, and debit-credit equality."
msgstr ""
"`beforeTransfer .+ additions` で作った記録は, 元の費用 1,200 円と追加した減"
"少 600 円を保持します. この記録には暗黙の bar を適用しません. `Balances "
"after transfer` を出力するときは, 合わせた記録に `bar` を適用してください. 支"
"払家賃は 600 円, 前払費用は 600 円, 現金は 1,800 円の増加, 預金は 3,000 円の"
"減少です. 振替は支払の分類を変え, 現金, 預金, 通貨, 貸借の一致を保ちます."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:115
msgid ""
"Applying the same `Portion 1 2` table again would move half the remaining "
"rent balance. Add this adjusting entry once for the stated January 31 "
"adjustment."
msgstr ""
"同じ `Portion 1 2` の表を再び適用すると, 残っている家賃残高の半分が振り替わり"
"ます. 指定した 1 月 31 日の調整ではこの整理仕訳を 1 回加えてください."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:123
msgid "`from .-> to \\|% Relabel`"
msgstr "`from .-> to \\|% Relabel`"

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:123
msgid ""
"Move the whole exact balance from source to destination. The bases omit "
"`Hat`/`Not`; the destination's direction is derived to retain the source "
"balance's debit or credit side."
msgstr ""
"厳密な残高全体を振替元から振替先へ移します. 基底には `Hat`/`Not` を含めませ"
"ん. 振替先の方向は, 振替元残高の借方または貸方の側を保つように決まります."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:124
msgid "`from .-> to \\|% Portion n d`"
msgstr "`from .-> to \\|% Portion n d`"

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:124
msgid "Move `n/d` of the balance, with `0 < n <= d`."
msgstr "残高の `n/d` を振り替えます. `0 < n <= d` が必要です."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:125
msgid "`mkTransferTable rows`"
msgstr "`mkTransferTable rows`"

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:125
msgid ""
"Validate rows and return `Either`. Reject invalid portions, overlapping "
"sources, and backward flow, including a cycle or a row to itself. Keep the "
"written row order."
msgstr ""
"行を検証して `Either` を返します. 不正な割合, 振替元の重複, 循環や自分自身へ"
"の行を含む逆向きの流れを拒否します. 書いた行の順を保ちます."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:126
msgid "`transferEntries table record`"
msgstr "`transferEntries table record`"

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:126
msgid ""
"Return `Either` containing only the additional cancellation and destination "
"postings. Read exact balances; retain the original record by adding the "
"result with `.+`."
msgstr ""
"追加する取消しと振替先の項だけを含む `Either` を返します. 厳密な残高を読みま"
"す. 結果を `.+` で加えて元の記録を保持してください."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:127
msgid "`transferEntriesWith rounding table record`"
msgstr "`transferEntriesWith rounding table record`"

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:127
msgid ""
"Choose the rounding rule for portions. The default of `transferEntries` is "
"`Nearest`."
msgstr "割合の丸め規則を選びます. `transferEntries` の既定値は `Nearest` です."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:129
msgid ""
"The preprint orders rules by source base; the accounting table instead uses "
"the supplied row order. Each row reads the balances left by earlier rows. A "
"whole-balance transfer table closes its selected sources and is idempotent "
"after its entries have been added. A portion table generally is not "
"idempotent."
msgstr ""
"プレプリントは振替元の基底で規則を並べますが, 会計用の表は指定した行の順を使"
"います. 各行は先行する行を適用した後の残高を読みます. 残高全体を振り替える表"
"は, 仕訳を加えた後に選択した振替元をゼロにし, 再適用しても変化しません. 割合"
"を振り替える表は一般に再適用で変化します."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:131
msgid ""
"A transfer can fail on selected invalid postings, unclassified accounts, or "
"an amount that cannot be represented under the rounding rule. Handle `Left` "
"before adding any entries; no partial successful record is returned. Use "
"positive, finite amounts through `.@`, as in [Construction and scalar checks]"
"(../algebra/values.md#construction-and-scalar-checks)."
msgstr ""
"振替は, 選択した項が不正な場合, 勘定科目が未分類の場合, 丸め規則で額を表現で"
"きない場合に失敗することがあります. 項を加える前に `Left` を処理してくださ"
"い. 部分的に成功した記録は返しません. [構築時とスカラーの検査](../algebra/"
"values.md#construction-and-scalar-checks)と同様に, 正の有限額を `.@` で構築し"
"てください."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:133
msgid ""
"The generic `ExchangeAlgebra.Algebra.Transfer` API works on individual "
"postings and is separate from this accounting API. Unit conversion changes "
"the measure of an amount and is not the accounting reclassification used for "
"the rent adjustment."
msgstr ""
"汎用の `ExchangeAlgebra.Algebra.Transfer` API は個々の項に作用し, この会計 "
"API とは別です. 単位換算は額の測定単位を変えます. 家賃の調整で使う会計上の付"
"け替えとは異なります."

#: src/journal/journal.md:3
msgid ""
"The January 10 withdrawal has a date and a description, “Withdrawal from "
"Bank A.” Keep those facts in a journal note so they remain available for "
"selecting transactions without becoming coordinates of the account balance. "
"A `Journal n v b` associates each note of type `n` with an `Alg v b`."
msgstr ""
"1 月 10 日の引き出しには, 日付と「A 銀行からの引き出し」という説明がありま"
"す. これらを仕訳帳の摘要 (note) に保持すると, 勘定残高の座標に含めずに取引を"
"選択できます. `Journal n v b` は型 `n` の各摘要に `Alg v b` を対応させます."

#: src/journal/journal.md:5
msgid ""
"Use exchangealgebra-0.6.0.1 in the project prepared in [Add the package to a "
"Stack project](../usage/installation.md#add-the-package-to-a-stack-project). "
"The example attaches notes to the month's transactions from [The redundant "
"algebra](../algebra/redundant.md), adds a February purchase, then selects "
"entries by note, base, and date range. The note set, finite journal, and "
"operations correspond to [Definitions 10–12](../algebra/"
"definitions.md#notes)."
msgstr ""
"[Stack プロジェクトにパッケージを追加する](../usage/installation.md#add-the-"
"package-to-a-stack-project)に従い, exchangealgebra-0.6.0.1 を使ってください. "
"例では[冗長代数](../algebra/redundant.md)で扱った月の取引に摘要を付け, 2 月の"
"仕入を加えてから, 摘要, 基底, 日付の範囲で仕訳を選びます. 摘要の集合, 有限台"
"を持つ仕訳帳, 演算は[定義 10–12](../algebra/definitions.md#notes)に対応しま"
"す."

#: src/journal/journal.md:7
msgid "Declare a note type"
msgstr "摘要の型を宣言する"

#: src/journal/journal.md:9
msgid ""
"Save the code blocks in their displayed order as `Main.hs`. Import the "
"journal module qualified to distinguish its constructors and queries from "
"algebra operations:"
msgstr ""
"コードブロックを表示順に `Main.hs` として保存してください. 仕訳帳の構築子と問"
"い合わせを代数の演算から区別するため, 仕訳帳のモジュールを qualified で "
"import してください:"

#: src/journal/journal.md:37
msgid "Declare a note containing the date and description:"
msgstr "日付と説明を含む摘要を宣言してください:"

#: src/journal/journal.md:40
msgid ""
"-- | A year, month, and day, compared in calendar order for the valid dates "
"used here.\n"
"-- This alias does not validate dates or distinguish them from other integer "
"tuples.\n"
msgstr ""
"-- | 年, 月, 日を表し, 例で使う有効な日付を暦順に比較します.\n"
"-- この別名は日付を検証せず, 他の整数の組と型で区別しません.\n"

#: src/journal/journal.md:43
msgid ""
"-- | Date and description shared by all postings in one journal entry.\n"
msgstr "-- | 1 つの仕訳を構成する全ての項で共有する日付と摘要です.\n"

#: src/journal/journal.md:46
msgid "-- ^ Calendar date of the transaction.\n"
msgstr "-- ^ 取引の暦日です.\n"

#: src/journal/journal.md:47
msgid "-- ^ Human-readable description.\n"
msgstr "-- ^ 人が読むための摘要です.\n"

#: src/journal/journal.md:51
msgid "\"\""
msgstr "\"\""

#: src/journal/journal.md:52
msgid ""
"-- | Metadata for the withdrawal; the blank note is reserved for "
"aggregation.\n"
msgstr "-- | 引き出しのメタデータです. 空の摘要は集約のために予約します.\n"

#: src/journal/journal.md:55 src/journal/journal.md:99
msgid "\"Withdrawal from Bank A\""
msgstr "\"Withdrawal from Bank A\""

#: src/journal/journal.md:58
msgid ""
"`EntryDate` is a tuple ordered by year, month, and day. The example supplies "
"valid dates directly; the alias performs no calendar validation. `EntryNote` "
"derives equality, total ordering, display, and hashing. `Typeable`, another "
"superclass of `Note`, is supplied automatically by GHC. Define the "
"distinguished empty note with `plank`; the remaining methods have defaults."
msgstr ""
"`EntryDate` は年, 月, 日の順に比較されるタプルです. 例では有効な日付を直接指"
"定し, 別名による暦の検証は行いません. `EntryNote` は等値比較, 全順序, 表示, "
"ハッシュを導出します. `Note` の別のスーパークラスである `Typeable` は GHC が"
"自動的に備えます. 特別な空の摘要を `plank` で定義してください. 残りのメソッド"
"には既定の実装があります."

#: src/journal/journal.md:60
msgid ""
"The value `EntryNote (0, 0, 0) \"\"` is reserved for the empty note and is "
"not a transaction date. `plank` is also the all-notes wildcard for "
"`projWithNote`. A note identifies a group of postings, not necessarily a "
"unique transaction: two entries with exactly the same date and description "
"share a key and their postings are added. Include a transaction identifier "
"in a note if those entries must remain separately selectable."
msgstr ""
"`EntryNote (0, 0, 0) \"\"` は空の摘要として予約し, 取引の日付には使いません. "
"`plank` は `projWithNote` で全摘要を選ぶ wildcard でもあります. 摘要は項のま"
"とまりを識別しますが, 必ずしも取引を一意に識別しません. 日付と説明が完全に等"
"しい 2 つの仕訳はキーを共有し, 項が加算されます. 別々に選ぶ必要があれば, 取引"
"識別子を摘要に含めてください."

#: src/journal/journal.md:62
msgid "Attach notes to the month"
msgstr "月の取引に摘要を付ける"

#: src/journal/journal.md:64
msgid ""
"Construct each transaction as an algebra, then attach its note once with "
"`Journal..|`:"
msgstr "各取引を代数として構築し, `Journal..|` で摘要を 1 回付けてください:"

#: src/journal/journal.md:76
msgid "-- | January 20: buy goods for 500 yen in cash.\n"
msgstr "-- | 1 月 20 日: 現金で商品を 500 円仕入れます.\n"

#: src/journal/journal.md:81
msgid "-- | January 25: exchange 1,500 yen for 10 dollars without a fee.\n"
msgstr "-- | 1 月 25 日: 手数料なしで 1,500 円を 10 ドルに交換します.\n"

#: src/journal/journal.md:86
msgid "-- | February 1: buy goods for 400 yen in cash.\n"
msgstr "-- | 2 月 1 日: 現金で商品を 400 円仕入れます.\n"

#: src/journal/journal.md:91
msgid ""
"-- | Metadata for the February purchase, excluded by the January date "
"range.\n"
msgstr "-- | 2 月の仕入のメタデータです. 1 月の期間選択では除かれます.\n"

#: src/journal/journal.md:94 src/journal/journal.md:100
msgid "\"Purchase of goods\""
msgstr "\"Purchase of goods\""

#: src/journal/journal.md:95
msgid ""
"-- | January transactions and one February purchase, each with a date and "
"description.\n"
msgstr ""
"-- | 1 月の取引と 2 月の仕入 1 件を, それぞれの日付と摘要で記録します.\n"

#: src/journal/journal.md:101
msgid "\"Yen-dollar exchange\""
msgstr "\"Yen-dollar exchange\""

#: src/journal/journal.md:105
msgid ""
"The two postings of the January 10 withdrawal share `withdrawalNote`. The "
"January 15 withdrawal has a different date, so it remains separately "
"selectable even though its description is the same. Adding journals with `."
"+` keeps the notes and concatenates the posting sequences at a shared note; "
"it does not net the postings."
msgstr ""
"1 月 10 日の引き出しを構成する 2 項は `withdrawalNote` を共有します. 1 月 15 "
"日の引き出しは日付が異なるので, 説明が同じでも別々に選べます. 仕訳帳を `.+` "
"で加えると, 摘要を保ち, 共通の摘要では項の列を連結します. 項の相殺は行いませ"
"ん."

#: src/journal/journal.md:107
msgid ""
"The January 20 purchase debits Purchases and credits Cash. The January 25 "
"exchange reduces yen cash by 1,500 yen and increases dollar cash by 10 "
"dollars at 150 yen per dollar, without a fee. Keep currencies separate when "
"totaling amounts; the raw yen and dollar numbers are not a common-unit debit-"
"credit comparison."
msgstr ""
"1 月 20 日の仕入は借方に Purchases, 貸方に Cash を記録します. 1 月 25 日の交"
"換は, 手数料なしで 1 ドル 150 円とし, 円の現金を 1,500 円減らし, ドルの現金"
"を 10 ドル増やします. 額の合計では通貨を分けてください. 円とドルの換算前の数"
"値は, 共通単位での貸借比較にはなりません."

#: src/journal/journal.md:109
msgid ""
"On February 1, the business buys another 400 yen of goods for cash. Record a "
"debit to Purchases and a credit to Cash, both for 400 yen. `transactions` "
"contains the four January entries and this February entry."
msgstr ""
"2 月 1 日には, 現金でさらに 400 円の商品を仕入れます. 借方に Purchases, 貸方"
"に Cash を各 400 円記録してください. `transactions` は 1 月の 4 件とこの 2 月"
"の仕訳を含みます."

#: src/journal/journal.md:111
msgid "Select by note, base, and date"
msgstr "摘要, 基底, 日付で選ぶ"

#: src/journal/journal.md:113
msgid ""
"For a date range, test the date field with `filterWithNote`. Use an "
"inclusive lower bound and an exclusive upper bound:"
msgstr ""
"日付の範囲では `filterWithNote` で日付フィールドを検査してください. 下限を含"
"め, 上限を含めない範囲を使ってください:"

#: src/journal/journal.md:116
msgid "-- | Select entries with an inclusive lower and exclusive upper date.\n"
msgstr "-- | 下限の日付を含み上限の日付を含まない範囲で仕訳を選びます.\n"

#: src/journal/journal.md:119
msgid "-- | Keep the notes while selecting the dates in January.\n"
msgstr "-- | 摘要を保って 1 月の日付を選びます.\n"

#: src/journal/journal.md:125
msgid ""
"`january` contains the four January entries and excludes the February 1 "
"purchase. The predicate selects by date even when the descriptions differ. "
"`projWithNote [withdrawalNote]` instead selects an exact note, including "
"both its date and description. `projWithBase` selects postings while "
"retaining their notes, and `projWithNoteBase` combines both restrictions."
msgstr ""
"`january` は 1 月の 4 件を含み, 2 月 1 日の仕入を除きます. この述語は説明が異"
"なっても日付で選びます. 一方, `projWithNote [withdrawalNote]` は日付と説明を"
"ともに含む摘要全体の一致で選びます. `projWithBase` は摘要を保持して項を選び, "
"`projWithNoteBase` は両方の制限を合わせます."

#: src/journal/journal.md:127
msgid "Total amounts and combine notes"
msgstr "額を合計して摘要をまとめる"

#: src/journal/journal.md:129
msgid ""
"Print the February entry before and after date selection, the selected "
"January records, the gross cash amount, and the cash balances:"
msgstr ""
"日付による選択の前後で 2 月の仕訳を出力し, 選んだ 1 月の記録, 現金の総額, 現"
"金の残高も出力してください:"

#: src/journal/journal.md:135
msgid ""
"-- | Ask questions by note, base, and date, then combine notes for net "
"balances.\n"
msgstr ""
"-- | 摘要, 基底, 日付で問い合わせ, 残高を求めるために摘要をまとめます.\n"

#: src/journal/journal.md:139
msgid "\"February 1 entry before date selection\""
msgstr "\"February 1 entry before date selection\""

#: src/journal/journal.md:141
msgid "\"February 1 entry after January selection\""
msgstr "\"February 1 entry after January selection\""

#: src/journal/journal.md:143
msgid "\"January 10 entry\""
msgstr "\"January 10 entry\""

#: src/journal/journal.md:144
msgid "\"January 10 cash postings\""
msgstr "\"January 10 cash postings\""

#: src/journal/journal.md:146
msgid "\"January yen cash postings\""
msgstr "\"January yen cash postings\""

#: src/journal/journal.md:148
msgid "\"January gross yen cash amount\""
msgstr "\"January gross yen cash amount\""

#: src/journal/journal.md:150
msgid "\"January cash balances by currency\""
msgstr "\"January cash balances by currency\""

#: src/journal/journal.md:152
msgid "\"Gathered January record\""
msgstr "\"Gathered January record\""

#: src/journal/journal.md:153
msgid "\"Bar across notes at plank\""
msgstr "\"Bar across notes at plank\""

#: src/journal/journal.md:156
msgid ""
"Run `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o journal-example`, then run "
"`./journal-example` in your project directory. The program prints:"
msgstr ""
"プロジェクトのディレクトリで `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o "
"journal-example` を実行し, 続いて `./journal-example` を実行してください. プ"
"ログラムは次を出力します:"

#: src/journal/journal.md:158
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"February 1 entry before date selection: 400:@Not:<(Purchases,Yen) .+ "
"400:@Hat:<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate = (2026,2,1), entryDescription "
"= \"Purchase of goods\"}\n"
"February 1 entry after January selection: 0\n"
"January 10 entry: 3000:@Hat:<(Deposits,Yen) .+ 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .| "
"EntryNote {entryDate = (2026,1,10), entryDescription = \"Withdrawal from "
"Bank A\"}\n"
"January 10 cash postings: 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate = "
"(2026,1,10), entryDescription = \"Withdrawal from Bank A\"}\n"
"January yen cash postings: (500:@Hat:<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate = "
"(2026,1,20), entryDescription = \"Purchase of goods\"}) .+ (3000:@Not:"
"<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate = (2026,1,10), entryDescription = "
"\"Withdrawal from Bank A\"}) .+ (2000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote "
"{entryDate = (2026,1,15), entryDescription = \"Withdrawal from Bank A\"}) .+ "
"(1500:@Hat:<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate = (2026,1,25), "
"entryDescription = \"Yen-dollar exchange\"})\n"
"January gross yen cash amount: 7000\n"
"January cash balances by currency: 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 10:@Not:"
"<(Cash,Dollar)\n"
"Gathered January record: 500:@Hat:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 1500:@Hat:<(Cash,Yen) .+ "
"2000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 10:@Not:<(Cash,Dollar) .+ "
"2000:@Hat:<(Deposits,Yen) .+ 3000:@Hat:<(Deposits,Yen) .+ 500:@Not:"
"<(Purchases,Yen)\n"
"Bar across notes at plank: 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 10:@Not:<(Cash,Dollar) ."
"+ 5000:@Hat:<(Deposits,Yen) .+ 500:@Not:<(Purchases,Yen)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"February 1 entry before date selection: 400:@Not:<(Purchases,Yen) .+ "
"400:@Hat:<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate = (2026,2,1), entryDescription "
"= \"Purchase of goods\"}\n"
"February 1 entry after January selection: 0\n"
"January 10 entry: 3000:@Hat:<(Deposits,Yen) .+ 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .| "
"EntryNote {entryDate = (2026,1,10), entryDescription = \"Withdrawal from "
"Bank A\"}\n"
"January 10 cash postings: 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate = "
"(2026,1,10), entryDescription = \"Withdrawal from Bank A\"}\n"
"January yen cash postings: (500:@Hat:<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate = "
"(2026,1,20), entryDescription = \"Purchase of goods\"}) .+ (3000:@Not:"
"<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate = (2026,1,10), entryDescription = "
"\"Withdrawal from Bank A\"}) .+ (2000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote "
"{entryDate = (2026,1,15), entryDescription = \"Withdrawal from Bank A\"}) .+ "
"(1500:@Hat:<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate = (2026,1,25), "
"entryDescription = \"Yen-dollar exchange\"})\n"
"January gross yen cash amount: 7000\n"
"January cash balances by currency: 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 10:@Not:"
"<(Cash,Dollar)\n"
"Gathered January record: 500:@Hat:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 1500:@Hat:<(Cash,Yen) .+ "
"2000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 10:@Not:<(Cash,Dollar) .+ "
"2000:@Hat:<(Deposits,Yen) .+ 3000:@Hat:<(Deposits,Yen) .+ 500:@Not:"
"<(Purchases,Yen)\n"
"Bar across notes at plank: 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 10:@Not:<(Cash,Dollar) ."
"+ 5000:@Hat:<(Deposits,Yen) .+ 500:@Not:<(Purchases,Yen)\n"
"```"

#: src/journal/journal.md:170
msgid ""
"`February 1 entry before date selection` contains the 400-yen purchase with "
"its February date. `February 1 entry after January selection` is `0`, so the "
"purchase is absent from the January selection."
msgstr ""
"`February 1 entry before date selection` は, 400 円の仕入を 2 月の日付ととも"
"に含みます. `February 1 entry after January selection` は `0` なので, この仕"
"入は 1 月の選択結果には含まれません."

#: src/journal/journal.md:172
msgid ""
"`January gross yen cash amount` is 7,000 yen: increases of 3,000 and 2,000 "
"plus decreases of 500 and 1,500. `norm` counts all selected amounts in both "
"directions. For `January cash balances by currency`, `toAlg` removes the "
"note keys without netting, and `bar` then cancels within each account-and-"
"currency base. The resulting cash changes are 3,000 yen and 10 dollars."
msgstr ""
"`January gross yen cash amount` は 7,000 円です. 増加 3,000 円と 2,000 円に, "
"減少 500 円と 1,500 円を加えた額です. `norm` は両方向で選ばれた額を全て数えま"
"す. `January cash balances by currency` では, `toAlg` は摘要のキーを除き, 相"
"殺は行いません. 続いて `bar` が勘定科目と通貨の基底ごとに相殺します. 現金の変"
"化は 3,000 円と 10 ドルです."

#: src/journal/journal.md:174
msgid ""
"`Journal.gather Journal.plank january` combines all entries under the empty "
"note without canceling opposing postings. `bar january` combines the notes "
"under `plank` and nets the combined algebra. It loses the original dates and "
"descriptions. A component under `plank` is printed without a note suffix, "
"but the value remains a `Journal`. To net separately within each note, use "
"`Journal.map bar january`; retain `january` itself when the original posting "
"detail is required."
msgstr ""
"`Journal.gather Journal.plank january` は逆方向の項を相殺せず, 全ての仕訳を空"
"の摘要にまとめます. `bar january` は摘要を `plank` にまとめてから代数を相殺し"
"ます. 元の日付と説明は失われます. `plank` に対応する成分は摘要の接尾辞なしで"
"表示されますが, 値は `Journal` のままです. 摘要ごとに相殺するには "
"`Journal.map bar january` を使ってください. 元の項の詳細が必要なときは "
"`january` 自体を保持してください."

#: src/journal/journal.md:180
msgid "Type or operation"
msgstr "型または演算"

#: src/journal/journal.md:182
msgid "`Note n`"
msgstr "`Note n`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:182
msgid ""
"Requires `Show`, `Eq`, `Ord`, `Hashable`, and `Typeable`. Define `plank`; "
"`isPlank` defaults to equality with `plank`."
msgstr ""
"`Show`, `Eq`, `Ord`, `Hashable`, `Typeable` が必要です. `plank` を定義してく"
"ださい. `isPlank` の既定値は `plank` との等値比較です."

#: src/journal/journal.md:183
msgid "`algebra Journal..\\| note`"
msgstr "`algebra Journal..\\| note`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:183
msgid ""
"Attach one note to all postings of an algebra. A zero algebra produces an "
"empty journal."
msgstr ""
"代数の全ての項に 1 つの摘要を付けます. ゼロの代数からは空の仕訳帳が得られま"
"す."

#: src/journal/journal.md:184
msgid "`Journal.fromList entries`"
msgstr "`Journal.fromList entries`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:184
msgid ""
"Sum a list of journals, combining equal note keys with redundant addition."
msgstr "仕訳帳のリストを合計し, 等しい摘要のキーでは冗長加算で合わせます."

#: src/journal/journal.md:185
msgid "`Journal.sigma items f`"
msgstr "`Journal.sigma items f`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:185
msgid "Sum the journals produced by applying `f` to the items."
msgstr "各要素に `f` を適用して得られる仕訳帳を合計します."

#: src/journal/journal.md:186
msgid "`Journal.projWithNote notes journal`"
msgstr "`Journal.projWithNote notes journal`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:186
msgid ""
"Select exact note keys. A list containing `plank` selects all notes; an "
"empty list selects none."
msgstr ""
"摘要のキー全体の一致で選びます. `plank` を含むリストは全摘要を選び, 空のリス"
"トは何も選びません."

#: src/journal/journal.md:187
msgid "`Journal.projWithBase bases journal`"
msgstr "`Journal.projWithBase bases journal`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:187
msgid ""
"Select matching postings at every note. Drop a note whose selected algebra "
"is zero."
msgstr "各摘要から一致する項を選びます. 選んだ代数がゼロになる摘要は除きます."

#: src/journal/journal.md:188
msgid "`Journal.projWithNoteBase notes bases journal`"
msgstr "`Journal.projWithNoteBase notes bases journal`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:188
msgid ""
"Restrict notes and bases. An empty note list or a list containing `plank` "
"imposes no note restriction. An empty base list selects nothing."
msgstr ""
"摘要と基底を制限します. 摘要のリストが空または `plank` を含む場合は, 摘要を制"
"限しません. 基底のリストが空なら何も選びません."

#: src/journal/journal.md:189
msgid "`Journal.filterWithNote predicate journal`"
msgstr "`Journal.filterWithNote predicate journal`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:189
msgid "Keep note-algebra pairs satisfying the predicate."
msgstr "述語を満たす摘要と代数の対を保持します."

#: src/journal/journal.md:190
msgid "`Journal.toAlg journal`"
msgstr "`Journal.toAlg journal`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:190
msgid ""
"Remove note keys and add their algebras, retaining posting amounts without "
"netting."
msgstr "摘要のキーを除いて代数を加算し, 相殺せずに項の額を保持します."

#: src/journal/journal.md:191
msgid "`Journal.gather note journal`"
msgstr "`Journal.gather note journal`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:191
msgid "Put the combined algebra under the specified note, without netting."
msgstr "指定した摘要の下に代数をまとめます. 相殺は行いません."

#: src/journal/journal.md:192
msgid "`bar journal`"
msgstr "`bar journal`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:192
msgid "Gather under `plank`, then net the combined algebra."
msgstr "`plank` の下にまとめてから代数を相殺します."

#: src/journal/journal.md:193
msgid "`Journal.map f journal`"
msgstr "`Journal.map f journal`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:193
msgid "Apply an algebra transformation separately at each note."
msgstr "摘要ごとに代数の変換を適用します."

#: src/journal/journal.md:195
msgid ""
"Hat and scalar multiplication preserve note keys. `compress` aggregates "
"within each note, while `norm` totals all amounts across notes. An account "
"projection of the raw journal retains opposing amounts in different notes. "
"Combine the notes before reading a balance that must cancel an original "
"entry against an adjustment recorded under a different note."
msgstr ""
"Hat とスカラー倍は摘要のキーを保持します. `compress` は摘要ごとに集約し, "
"`norm` は摘要をまたいで全ての額を合計します. 元の仕訳帳を勘定科目で射影する"
"と, 異なる摘要にある逆方向の額が保持されます. 元の仕訳と別の摘要に記録した調"
"整を相殺して残高を読むときは, 先に摘要をまとめてください."

#: src/journal/agents.md:3
msgid ""
"The January 10 withdrawal appears in two accounting records. The business "
"receives 3,000 yen in cash and reduces its deposit asset. Bank A reduces the "
"deposit liability it owes to the business and pays out 3,000 yen in cash. "
"Add an owner axis to keep both records in one algebra while retaining whose "
"accounts each posting describes."
msgstr ""
"1 月 10 日の引き出しは 2 つの会計記録に現れます. 事業者は現金を 3,000 円受け"
"取り, 預金資産を減らします. A 銀行は事業者に対する預金負債を減らし, 現金を "
"3,000 円払い出します. 主体の軸を加え, 各項が誰の勘定を記述するかを保ったま"
"ま, 両方の記録を 1 つの代数に並べてください."

#: src/journal/agents.md:5
msgid ""
"Use exchangealgebra-0.6.0.1 in the project prepared in [Add the package to a "
"Stack project](../usage/installation.md#add-the-package-to-a-stack-project). "
"The example extends [Record the withdrawal](../exchange/exchange.md#record-"
"the-withdrawal) from `HatBase (AccountTitles, Unit)` to `HatBase "
"(AccountTitles, Owner, Unit)`. The same algebra operations apply to bases "
"that also identify the accounting subject."
msgstr ""
"[Stack プロジェクトにパッケージを追加する](../usage/installation.md#add-the-"
"package-to-a-stack-project)に従い, exchangealgebra-0.6.0.1 を使ってください. "
"例では[引き出しを記録する](../exchange/exchange.md#record-the-withdrawal)の基"
"底を `HatBase (AccountTitles, Unit)` から `HatBase (AccountTitles, Owner, "
"Unit)` へ拡張します. 会計主体を識別する基底でも同じ代数演算が使えます."

#: src/journal/agents.md:7
msgid "Add the owner axis"
msgstr "主体の軸を加える"

#: src/journal/agents.md:9
msgid ""
"Save the code blocks in their displayed order as `Main.hs`. Retain the "
"currency declaration:"
msgstr ""
"コードブロックを表示順に `Main.hs` として保存してください. 通貨の宣言を保って"
"ください:"

#: src/journal/agents.md:31
msgid "Declare the owners and account access for the expanded base:"
msgstr "主体と, 拡張した基底で勘定科目へアクセスする方法を宣言してください:"

#: src/journal/agents.md:34
msgid "-- | Owners of the two accounting records.\n"
msgstr "-- | 2 つの会計記録の主体です.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:36
msgid "-- ^ The business withdrawing its own deposit.\n"
msgstr "-- ^ 自分の預金を引き出す事業者です.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:37
msgid "-- ^ The bank paying out the withdrawal.\n"
msgstr "-- ^ 引き出しに応じて現金を払い出す銀行です.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:43
msgid "-- | Account access for bases with an owner and a currency.\n"
msgstr "-- | 主体と通貨を持つ基底で勘定科目へアクセスします.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:50
msgid ""
"`Business` and `BankA` identify the owners of the accounts. `Owner` is the "
"wildcard coordinate, used in queries to select both owners. "
"`getAccountTitle` reads the account coordinate, and `setAccountTitle` "
"changes only that coordinate. This custom base shape needs its own "
"`ExBaseClass` instance; the `Alg` exchange operations are unchanged."
msgstr ""
"`Business` と `BankA` は勘定を持つ主体を識別します. `Owner` は問い合わせで両"
"主体を選ぶ wildcard 座標です. `getAccountTitle` は勘定科目の座標を読み, "
"`setAccountTitle` はその座標だけを変えます. この自作の基底の形には固有の "
"`ExBaseClass` instance が必要ですが, `Alg` の交換代数演算は変わりません."

#: src/journal/agents.md:52
msgid "Record both sides of the withdrawal"
msgstr "引き出しを両主体で記録する"

#: src/journal/agents.md:54
msgid "Construct each owner's balanced record, then add the records:"
msgstr "各主体の均衡した記録を構築し, 加えてください:"

#: src/journal/agents.md:57
msgid "-- | The business receives cash and reduces its deposit asset.\n"
msgstr "-- | 事業者は現金を受け取り, 預金資産を減らします.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:61
msgid "-- | Bank A reduces its deposit liability and pays out cash.\n"
msgstr "-- | A 銀行は預金負債を減らし, 現金を払い出します.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:66
msgid ""
"-- | Retain both owners' records in one algebra without canceling between "
"owners.\n"
msgstr "-- | 主体間で相殺せず, 両主体の記録を 1 つの代数に保持します.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:72
msgid ""
"The business debits Cash and credits Deposits. Bank A debits DepositPayable, "
"an ordinary liability account for deposits accepted, and credits Cash. The "
"bank's liability decrease has direction `Hat` but is a debit because an "
"ordinary liability's home side is credit. Both bank postings therefore use "
"`Hat`, yet they fall on opposite debit and credit sides."
msgstr ""
"事業者は借方に Cash, 貸方に Deposits を記録します. A 銀行は借方に通常の負債勘"
"定である受入預金 DepositPayable, 貸方に Cash を記録します. 通常の負債は本来の"
"貸借の側が貸方なので, 銀行の負債の減少は方向が `Hat` でも借方です. したがって"
"銀行の両項は `Hat` を使いますが, 借方と貸方に分かれます."

#: src/journal/agents.md:74
msgid ""
"`DepositPayable` describes a bank deposit liability. `DepositsReceived` "
"describes other deposits held, so the bank record uses `DepositPayable`. "
"Neither owner records revenue or expense for this withdrawal. Every amount "
"remains nonnegative."
msgstr ""
"`DepositPayable` は銀行の預金負債を表します. `DepositsReceived` はそれ以外の"
"預り金を表すので, 銀行の記録には `DepositPayable` を使います. この引き出しで"
"はどちらの主体も収益や費用を記録しません. 全ての額は非負のままです."

#: src/journal/agents.md:76
msgid "Select owners and corresponding postings"
msgstr "主体と対応する項を選ぶ"

#: src/journal/agents.md:78
msgid ""
"Restrict the owner coordinate to read one owner's record. Select the deposit "
"asset and liability with separate patterns:"
msgstr ""
"主体の座標を制限して 1 主体の記録を読んでください. 別々のパターンで預金資産と"
"負債を選んでください:"

#: src/journal/agents.md:81
msgid "-- | Select one owner's complete accounting record.\n"
msgstr "-- | 1 主体の会計記録全体を選びます.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:84
msgid ""
"-- | Select the business deposit asset and the bank's corresponding "
"liability.\n"
msgstr "-- | 事業者の預金資産と, それに対応する銀行の負債を選びます.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:91
msgid ""
"`recordOf Business` contains both business postings, and `recordOf BankA` "
"contains both bank postings. The cash increase of the business corresponds "
"to the bank's cash decrease. The business's deposit asset decrease "
"corresponds to the bank's deposit liability decrease. These correspondences "
"concern the same transaction, but the full bases differ in owner or account, "
"so the terms do not cancel automatically."
msgstr ""
"`recordOf Business` は事業者の両項を含み, `recordOf BankA` は銀行の両項を含み"
"ます. 事業者の現金増加は銀行の現金減少に対応します. 事業者が預金資産を減らす"
"と, 銀行も対応する預金負債を減らします. 同じ取引に関する対応ですが, 完全な基"
"底は主体または勘定科目が異なるので, 項は自動的には相殺されません."

#: src/journal/agents.md:93
msgid "Check each owner's record"
msgstr "主体ごとの記録を確かめる"

#: src/journal/agents.md:95
msgid ""
"Print the owner selections, balance checks, and corresponding movements:"
msgstr "主体で選んだ結果, 貸借の検査, 対応する変化を出力してください:"

#: src/journal/agents.md:101
msgid ""
"-- | Inspect each owner and the corresponding cash and deposit movements.\n"
msgstr "-- | 主体ごとの記録と, 対応する現金および預金の変化を調べます.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:105
msgid "\"Business record\""
msgstr "\"Business record\""

#: src/journal/agents.md:106
msgid "\"Bank A record\""
msgstr "\"Bank A record\""

#: src/journal/agents.md:107
msgid "\"Business record is balanced\""
msgstr "\"Business record is balanced\""

#: src/journal/agents.md:108
msgid "\"Bank A record is balanced\""
msgstr "\"Bank A record is balanced\""

#: src/journal/agents.md:109
msgid "\"Combined record is balanced\""
msgstr "\"Combined record is balanced\""

#: src/journal/agents.md:110
msgid "\"Bank liability decrease side\""
msgstr "\"Bank liability decrease side\""

#: src/journal/agents.md:111
msgid "\"Corresponding deposit changes\""
msgstr "\"Corresponding deposit changes\""

#: src/journal/agents.md:112
msgid "\"Cash changes with owners retained\""
msgstr "\"Cash changes with owners retained\""

