msgstr "\"Bar retains separate owners\""

#: src/journal/agents.md:116
msgid ""
"Run `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o agents-example`, then run `./"
"agents-example` in your project directory. The program prints:"
msgstr ""
"プロジェクトのディレクトリで `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o "
"agents-example` を実行し, 続いて `./agents-example` を実行してください. プロ"
"グラムは次を出力します:"

#: src/journal/agents.md:130
msgid ""
"The business, bank, and combined records are balanced in yen. Check each "
"owner individually: a combined balance alone could conceal an imbalance in "
"one owner offset by another. `Bar retains separate owners` still contains "
"both owners' cash postings because `bar` cancels only within a full base, "
"including the owner coordinate."
msgstr ""
"事業者, 銀行, 両者を合わせた記録は円で貸借が均衡します. 主体ごとにも確かめて"
"ください. 合わせた記録だけでは, ある主体の不均衡が他の主体で打ち消される可能"
"性があります. `bar` は主体の座標を含む完全な基底ごとに相殺するので, `Bar "
"retains separate owners` は依然として両主体の現金の項を含みます."

#: src/journal/agents.md:132
msgid ""
"The owner axis identifies whose record a posting belongs to. It does not "
"identify a counterparty. With only one business and one bank the "
"correspondence is specified by the example. To identify particular pairs in "
"a larger set of transactions, add a counterparty coordinate or a shared "
"transaction identifier to the notes, as described in [Declare a note type]"
"(journal.md#declare-a-note-type)."
msgstr ""
"主体の軸は, 項が誰の記録に属するかを識別します. 相手方は識別しません. 事業者"
"と銀行が 1 つずつの例では対応を明示しています. 取引が多い場合に特定の対を識別"
"するには, [摘要の型を宣言する](journal.md#declare-a-note-type)で説明したよう"
"に, 相手方の座標か共通の取引識別子を摘要 (note) に加えてください."

#: src/journal/agents.md:138
msgid "Construction or operation"
msgstr "構築または演算"

#: src/journal/agents.md:140
msgid "`HatBase (AccountTitles, Owner, Unit)`"
msgstr "`HatBase (AccountTitles, Owner, Unit)`"

#: src/journal/agents.md:140
msgid ""
"Identify the account, its owner, and the currency. Direction is separate "
"from the tuple."
msgstr "勘定科目, 主体, 通貨を識別します. 方向はタプルの外にあります."

#: src/journal/agents.md:141
msgid "`Element Owner`"
msgstr "`Element Owner`"

#: src/journal/agents.md:141
msgid ""
"Supply a wildcard coordinate; derive consistent equality, ordering, and "
"hashing."
msgstr ""
"wildcard 座標を定義し, 整合する等値比較, 順序, ハッシュを導出してください."

#: src/journal/agents.md:142
msgid "`ExBaseClass` instance"
msgstr "`ExBaseClass` instance"

#: src/journal/agents.md:142
msgid ""
"Read and replace the account while preserving owner, currency, and direction."
msgstr "主体, 通貨, 方向を保ちながら勘定科目を読み出し, 置き換えます."

#: src/journal/agents.md:143
msgid "`proj [HatNot :< ((.#), owner, (.#))]`"
msgstr "`proj [HatNot :< ((.#), owner, (.#))]`"

#: src/journal/agents.md:143
msgid "Select one owner across accounts, directions, and currencies."
msgstr "勘定科目, 方向, 通貨を制限せずに 1 主体を選びます."

#: src/journal/agents.md:144
msgid "`proj [HatNot :< (Cash, (.#), Yen)]`"
msgstr "`proj [HatNot :< (Cash, (.#), Yen)]`"

#: src/journal/agents.md:144
msgid ""
"Select yen cash movements across owners, retaining the owner coordinates."
msgstr "主体の座標を保って, 主体をまたいだ円の現金の変化を選びます."

#: src/journal/agents.md:145
msgid "`balance (recordOf owner)`"
msgstr "`balance (recordOf owner)`"

#: src/journal/agents.md:145
msgid ""
"Compare debit and credit sums for the selected owner. The example uses only "
"yen."
msgstr "選択した主体の借方と貸方の合計を比べます. 例では円だけを使います."

#: src/journal/agents.md:146
msgid "`bar combined`"
msgstr "`bar combined`"

#: src/journal/agents.md:146
msgid "Net within each full base. Keep different owners separate."
msgstr "完全な基底ごとに相殺します. 異なる主体は分けて保ちます."

#: src/journal/agents.md:148
msgid ""
"An owner axis is an ordinary base axis under [Definitions 1–3](../algebra/"
"definitions.md#element-structure). The additional coordinate changes neither "
"redundant addition nor the [debit and credit decomposition](../algebra/"
"definitions.md#debit-and-credit-decomposition). It changes which postings "
"share a full base and which owner-specific queries can be asked."
msgstr ""
"主体の軸は[定義 1–3](../algebra/definitions.md#element-structure)に従う通常の"
"基底の軸です. 座標を加えても冗長加算と[借方と貸方への分解](../algebra/"
"definitions.md#debit-and-credit-decomposition)は変わりません. 完全な基底を共"
"有する項と, 主体ごとに可能な問い合わせが変わります."
